Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,预计在下一个05遭遇
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.98,0:02:05.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,固定与罗盘总部和奥尔德林自治政府的通话路线
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.97,0:02:09.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Operation Niner 022 展开行动
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.23,0:02:11.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和队准备出击
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.17,0:02:14.40,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,弹射位置 α队从20号推进器…
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌方是一个中队的规模
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不过这是现场部队的报告
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,数量再多预估一些也好
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是情况似乎很紧急
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.65,0:02:25.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.43,0:02:28.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom参战后 由辛负责守卫政府设施
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜玛丽亚和阿格尼丝 在引导市民疏散的同时
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.95,0:02:34.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,负责掩护奥尔德林军
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.51,0:02:35.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.25,0:02:39.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 前线的敌人我来消灭 请务必让我同行
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 我也要去
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 我不想扩大战场
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.23,0:02:46.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈肯队负责保护千年号
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,交给我吧 队长
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,弹射器连接
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全系统连线
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.50,0:02:56.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,航线清理完毕 没有障碍物
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.56,0:03:00.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防空监视组在 D2频道共享空域监视数据
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,红队完成撤离
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,格鲁古古 请出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.01,0:03:05.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜玛利亚·霍克机
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.56,0:03:07.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,格鲁古古 出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.26,0:03:11.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,强人奔流 请出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝·吉本拉特 强人 出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Justice 请出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.51,0:03:22.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真·飞鸟 Justice 出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.95,0:03:27.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来请Freedom出击
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和 Freedom 出击
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这里是世界和平监测组织罗盘
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.16,0:05:21.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,通告进攻部队 请立即停止战斗
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又用这些东西
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝 掩护我
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,说什么呢 我的机体是用于近战的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,该你来掩护我的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.07,0:06:37.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,该死 根本轮不到我发挥啊
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,后撤 战线后撤
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,并在卡纳吉市重建阵地
Dialogue: 2,0:06:51.07,0:06:53.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥尔德林防御司令部通知
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这场战斗的幕后黑手是米盖尔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.80,0:06:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要求控制卡纳吉市
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.54,0:06:59.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把米盖尔揪出来
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:07.94,Screen,卡纳基,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,765)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(944,975)}卡{\alpha&HFF&\t(85,85,1,\alpha&H00&)}纳{\alpha&HFF&\t(168,168,1,\alpha&H00&)}基{\alpha&HFF&\t(252,252,1,\alpha&H00&)}市{\alpha&HFF&\t(335,335,1,\alpha&H00&)}区
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:07.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,765)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)\alpha&HFF&\t(502,502,1,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(585,585,1,\alpha&H00&)}M{\alpha&HFF&\t(669,669,1,\alpha&H00&)}4{\alpha&HFF&\t(752,752,1,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(836,836,1,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(919,919,1,\alpha&H00&)}5
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.87,0:07:08.96,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,警告 请停止前进
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.19,0:07:11.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米盖尔上校不在这里
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,继续战斗会波及平民
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,形势一变就成这样了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但没有人会作出选择
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.64,0:07:25.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人们会忘记 然后重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,闪一边去
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们是米兰的仇人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么就是不懂呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.42,0:08:00.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然和真不是一个水平的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,734呼叫指挥中心
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.01,0:08:22.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,城市北部居民区有多人急需救援
Dialogue: 2,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,将他们转移到市民医院
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.27,0:08:25.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,指挥中心呼叫734
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因市民医院同样受灾 不予收治
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请等待临时急救站开放
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.92,0:08:34.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,312报告 火势已超出我们的应对范围 请求灭火队支援
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,165呼叫指挥中心 消防车因桥梁坍塌无法通过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:44.66,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,680)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}罗盘所属\N大天使级强袭激动特装舰大天使格纳库
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,准将等四人 请求登船
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,允许登船 辛苦了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:48.33,0:08:51.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哟 机体似乎都挺好的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样 新机型还习惯吗
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.01,0:08:55.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.69,0:08:56.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,伤亡情况如何
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.31,0:09:06.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目前已有257人死亡 其中包括68名平民
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也许还会增加
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.91,0:09:11.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这次没有母舰
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只能靠MS发动奇袭
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是米盖尔的网络
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但他参战是假动作
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.95,0:09:23.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真正目的是让扎夫特侵犯国境
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.53,0:09:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他肯定是以为把名字作为诱饵 就一定会上钩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,每次都和 多玛 阿罗 莱哈 一样的把戏
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.05,0:09:33.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们还要这样持续多久
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.26,0:09:41.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,从一开始就不考虑回程的计划
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.59,0:09:43.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,驾驶员和机体都撑不住的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但他们还在继续
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以这才是问题所在
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.32,0:09:53.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,实际上 问题已经烂到根了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,宇宙伊拉 73
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,始于「Break the World」
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,地球与P.L.A.N.T.的新战斗
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.63,0:10:09.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,历经千辛万苦 终于落下帷幕
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.56,0:10:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,作为新世界系统而呈现的命运计划也是一样
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.99,0:10:19.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,随着其提出者杜兰达尔委员会主席的死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:22.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(732,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}L5宙域P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.11,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,一切都被埋葬了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:21.59,0:10:25.19,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,留下了深深的悲伤和混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:26.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.21,0:10:30.05,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,克莱因总裁不知道我军伤亡情况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市最高评议会大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(874,975)}楼内
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(906,975)}小会议室
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.68,0:10:35.15,Sub-CN - up,1,0,0,0,,遭受蓝色宇宙单方面入侵的 是我们啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.64,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,考虑到士兵们的感受
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.64,0:10:40.52,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,大和队长的行为太无情了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.88,Sub-CN,协调者 调整者,0,0,0,,自然人与调整者之间的裂痕
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仍然没有被修复
Dialogue: 2,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,加之各地发生的独立运动
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.29,0:10:55.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在米盖尔上校的带领下 蓝色宇宙一直进行着游击战
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.94,0:11:00.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,冲突和仇恨现在仍在上演
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,担心现状的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:11.07,0:11:14.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T. 奥布 大西洋联邦的指导者
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.12,0:11:18.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,成立世界和平监测组织罗盘
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.35,0:11:23.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,邀请拉克丝·克莱因担任第一任总裁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(870,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高评议会大厦内
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1056,975)}Evidence01
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1250,975)}Replicaobject
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,拉美德议长 让您忧心了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.79,0:11:29.43,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.95,0:11:34.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但贾格纳特等人不得不说一些严厉的话
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.04,0:11:37.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我听说军队内部的愤懑正在增长
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.21,0:11:38.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但只要罗盘在其中缓冲
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.36,0:11:44.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怨愤应该也不会集中爆发
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也有个极限啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.90,0:11:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然我清楚只有愚蠢的人才忘记不了仇恨
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我们也会被自己的情绪所支配
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.32,0:11:58.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们失去的太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.98,0:11:59.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.85,0:12:01.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡纳吉市的米盖尔最后在哪呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:03.29,0:12:07.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他的藏身之处果然是欧亚联邦的军事缓冲区吗
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.49,0:12:10.18,Sub-CN,为什么有个.,0,0,0,,很可能是
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使知道但我们也无能为力
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的现状啊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.03,0:12:22.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是千年号时隔一个月的回归吗
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.21,0:12:27.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这次准将能休息一会儿吗
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.43,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,是的 按计划来说是可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:32.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1086,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高评议会大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:32.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1126,975)}空中庭院
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.09,0:12:31.65,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,说起来 我虽然见过几次
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是个奇特的人呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和队长
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.02,0:12:47.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他安静得 看起来不像是个战士
Dialogue: 2,0:12:48.01,0:12:52.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,现在看来他正试图独自承担这场战争的矛盾
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.26,0:12:55.39,Sub-CN,，,0,0,0,,他很善良
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.74,0:12:56.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.66,0:13:03.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我得尽快让他自由
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.62,0:13:07.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在善良击垮他之前
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是塔奥阁下的…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请多关照 国防委员会主席
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这边请
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.24,0:13:25.10,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,以上就是基盘王国的奥拉女王的提议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(962,975)}奥布联合酋长国
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1036,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1118,975)}奥罗法特
Dialogue: 2,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,应该也向P.L.A.N.T.提交了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.68,0:13:32.85,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那个国家似乎已经非常准确地掌握了米盖尔的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.54,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(980,975)}欧普联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.54,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1016,975)}首长代表官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.96,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(806,975)}楼内
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.96,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(840,975)}首长代表办公室
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我认为值得合作
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.63,0:13:39.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是托亚
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.92,0:13:42.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,事物有两面性
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,回报是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,加入罗盘
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.95,0:13:53.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想以此为契机被国际社会承认为独立国家吗
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盘王国独立后
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.76,0:14:00.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,技术和经济都有着显著的发展
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但与欧亚联邦的关系不好
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.31,0:14:08.11,Sub-CN,调轴以适配屏字,0,0,0,,毕竟欧亚联邦各地也是借他们的机会大闹独立呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(914,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(952,975)}罗盘本部大厦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.20,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,指的是基盘王国冲击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:14.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,727)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(850,975)}楼内
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:14.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,727)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(880,975)}总裁办公室
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.23,0:14:15.37,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,为什么他们能实现如此惊人的复兴呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我听说是奥费·拉姆·塔奥的功劳
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.04,0:14:22.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,据说前议长迪兰达尔认可了他的才华
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,总裁对命运计划持怀疑态度吗
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 我不是…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.77,0:14:36.03,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们否认了迪兰达尔议长所展现的未来
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.52,0:14:40.15,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,然而有很多人被这种可能性所吸引
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.66,0:14:43.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不能否认那些人
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,确实啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.42,0:14:48.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而且如果允许他们加入罗盘
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.94,0:14:53.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘理事国和欧亚联邦之间的关系可能会更紧张
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.18,0:14:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但在六个月前的Freedom抢夺案中
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.51,0:15:00.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥布欠了他们一笔人情
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝反对吗
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,让我想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:14.72,Screen,一年前我删了,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,725)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,880)}奥布属奥诺戈罗岛
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.13,0:15:15.21,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但是拉克丝 这是…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是因为有人希望这样
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是我也希望
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.67,0:15:26.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和你一起战斗
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.56,0:15:31.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1014,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1044,975)}宙港
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.62,0:15:46.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我果然没被信任吗
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你看 队长总是一个人战斗
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.42,0:15:55.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也因此缩小了伤亡啊
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那我们的意义又是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.24,0:16:06.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长当时和我说
Dialogue: 2,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要一起战斗
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是被这些话所感动
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.27,0:16:16.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才加入罗盘的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.02,0:16:19.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 你又在胡思乱想了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.13,0:16:22.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是那样的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.39,0:16:23.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的意思是
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想变得更有用
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,帮上基拉队长的…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真不是被托付了Justice吗
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没被信任怎么…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.41,0:16:35.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么不可能呢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.43,0:16:38.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,尤其是被称为「Freedom Killer」的你
Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「Freedom Killer」
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.17,0:16:41.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 你不知道吗
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不知何时会背刺你的人
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的话绝对不想把他留在身边
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.46,0:16:50.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把Justice让给我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你操纵它也是暴殄天物
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.30,0:17:00.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,学院里我的技术和评价都更好
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.30,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,别说了 阿格尼丝
Dialogue: 2,0:17:02.81,0:17:05.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大战时我也觉得很怪
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.03,Sub-CN,*,0,0,0,,没想到你进了FAITH
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但到头来对迪兰达尔议长来说
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你就是个好用的棋子而已吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.44,0:17:15.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你够了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:21.01,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.67,0:17:21.83,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,奥尔德林自治区的伤亡情况已经高达428人死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:25.31,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}基拉和拉克丝的宅邸
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.97,0:17:26.77,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目前为止 蓝色宇宙残党已造成超过5000人的伤亡
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.33,0:17:29.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各国政府对此严重关切
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.64,0:17:33.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,同时对幕后黑手米盖尔上校进行国际通缉
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.38,0:17:37.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们正在努力瓦解此组织 但其下落尚未确认
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.93,0:17:42.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,蓝色宇宙的残党…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.05,0:17:45.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:17:47.31,0:17:48.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊哦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:55.66,0:17:56.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要太勉强自己啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.33,0:18:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不承认!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.01,0:18:03.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,费米子引导方式尚不可用
Dialogue: 2,0:18:03.39,0:18:06.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,微米级障碍物影响连接传感器出现错误 真的难以理解
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你认为可以解决吗
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,海因莱因上尉
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.03,0:18:12.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只能由我这个设计师来做了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我对开发部门的无能感到震惊
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,设置和适应Freedom都需要时间
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自我维持控制程序中的错误也是一个令人头疼的问题
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.28,0:18:22.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我来负责这个项目
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,传感器就麻烦海因莱因上尉了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.63,0:18:26.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起 准将
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不回家 真的好吗
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.78,0:18:33.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,克莱茵总裁不是在等您吗
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.83,0:18:40.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我需要能够尽快使用它
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.00,0:18:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,压倒敌人的能力是解决问题的最快方法
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是那样的
Dialogue: 2,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们没有保护好任何东西
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.64,0:19:18.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.20,0:19:59.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不会再发生那种事了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要让世界变成那样
Dialogue: 2,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,谁又能保证呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.45,0:20:09.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你口中的世界和我所展示的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.60,0:20:11.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家更想要哪一个
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.06,0:20:14.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有史以来
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.58,0:20:18.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人类史上战争从未停止过的原因
Dialogue: 2,0:20:19.33,0:20:22.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一直存在的 对我们来说最大的敌人
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.96,0:20:26.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是你任何时候都克服不了的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那就是我们自身的无知和贪婪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:06.03,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius郊外
Dialogue: 2,0:21:18.43,0:21:19.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米盖尔上校他
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.96,0:21:23.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好像潜伏在欧亚边境附近的埃尔多安
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,从基盘王国的奥拉陛下那收到了
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请求合力逮捕的亲笔信
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝你怎么打算
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.87,0:21:36.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话还在犹豫
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.25,0:21:39.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉你怎么想
Dialogue: 2,0:21:40.58,0:21:41.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么问我
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.59,0:21:43.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:49.32,0:21:51.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果事情能就此结束的话
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.41,0:21:53.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我没有反对的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.95,0:21:54.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这场战争看不到尽头
Dialogue: 2,0:21:58.05,0:21:59.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人是不会轻易改变的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.72,0:22:02.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.27,0:22:04.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能做到什么 不能做到什么
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.92,0:22:05.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:22:06.63,0:22:07.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能做到的事
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.06,0:22:10.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.20,0:22:14.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必须要有人去做
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.47,0:22:17.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果没有人做的话
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.30,0:22:25.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是欧亚联邦不承认罗盘吧
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.20,0:22:29.00,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,所以总裁自己要求同行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.70,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(966,975)}千年号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.70,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(996,975)}舰长室
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.40,0:22:32.53,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,也许会有政治谈判什么的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.14,0:22:36.00,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗨 老大们 小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:38.12,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(816,975)}千年号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:38.12,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(858,975)}休息室
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.42,0:22:38.52,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那里可能会有妖怪出没呢
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.93,0:22:39.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.59,0:22:41.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是基盘王国
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那里独立运动时
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.43,0:22:45.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欧亚人看到了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.94,0:22:47.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,凯尔派
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.82,0:22:48.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,凯尔派是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是生活在水里的怪物
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.61,PS,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs60}凯尔特民间传说中变成骏马外形诱拐路人的精灵
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.18,0:22:56.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是说 这个国家本身就像妖怪一样看不透摸不清
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.37,0:22:56.97,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.67,0:22:57.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怪物妖怪
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.21,0:22:59.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈肯大尉
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可以性骚扰
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.69,0:23:11.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距离突破大气层还有20秒
Dialogue: 2,0:23:12.07,0:23:13.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰桥遮蔽
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.31,0:23:14.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全舱壁封闭
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.59,0:23:18.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本舰即将突进大气层
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.56,0:23:20.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰桥向装甲区域转移
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.07,0:23:22.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,R2协议发令
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.89,0:23:25.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全员准备突入大气层
Dialogue: 2,0:23:25.24,0:23:27.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,冷却系统正常
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.29,0:23:28.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,高熱屏蔽运作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(992,975)}基盘王城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1068,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1148,975)}伊修塔利亚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.72,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1080,975)}基盘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.72,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1114,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.14,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1054,975)}基盘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.14,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1086,975)}议事厅
Dialogue: 2,0:23:47.22,0:23:49.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,重建的进展似乎比我想象的要快
Dialogue: 2,0:23:50.22,0:23:53.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为有非常优秀的人民或政府吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:53.78,0:23:54.67,Sub-CN,千年号 千禧年,0,0,0,,千年号
Dialogue: 2,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向右舷合流
Dialogue: 2,0:23:56.13,0:23:58.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对空对地继续警戒
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.81,0:24:03.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,下降路径和水深数据 没有问题
Dialogue: 2,0:24:04.21,0:24:06.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,悬浮器输出保持20
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.24,0:24:10.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,D人员确认并报告水密状况
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:33.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(912,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:33.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(948,975)}直升机场
Dialogue: 2,0:24:37.08,0:24:38.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欢迎您的到来 公主
Dialogue: 2,0:24:38.61,0:24:41.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是基盘王国的宰相奥费·拉姆·塔奥
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.01,0:24:43.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发自内心欢迎您的到来
Dialogue: 2,0:24:44.22,0:24:45.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘总裁
Dialogue: 2,0:24:45.45,0:24:46.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我叫拉克丝·克莱因
Dialogue: 2,0:24:47.23,0:24:49.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常荣幸能见到您
Dialogue: 2,0:25:03.86,0:25:05.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,终于能够见到你了
Dialogue: 2,0:25:06.20,0:25:07.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝·克莱因
Dialogue: 2,0:25:07.85,0:25:08.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:09.64,0:25:10.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:11.22,0:25:12.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是你的命运之人
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.77,0:25:16.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起引领世界之人
Dialogue: 2,0:25:19.70,0:25:20.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,0:25:33.58,0:25:34.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,碍事的家伙
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.66,0:25:36.32,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,发生了什么
Dialogue: 2,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,喂 快跑
Dialogue: 2,0:26:04.67,0:26:06.49,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到基盘王国
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:10.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,689)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(920,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:10.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,689)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(954,975)}谒见之间
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.33,0:26:08.78,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我是奥拉·玛哈·海贝尔
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.63,0:26:13.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此次罗盘的应对之迅速 吾深表感谢
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.68,0:26:19.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,承蒙您的接见 我深感荣幸 奥拉陛下
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.01,0:26:24.17,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,米盖尔的游击队 对于我们国家来说也是颇为棘手的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:24.63,0:26:27.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我已经多次向欧亚联邦提议
Dialogue: 2,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.58,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,但似乎回应还要花些时间
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.48,0:26:32.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没有办法
Dialogue: 2,0:26:33.18,0:26:36.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为那边国内还有许多火种存在
Dialogue: 2,0:26:37.42,0:26:42.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在此先向你们致谢 请保护我的国民
Dialogue: 2,0:26:42.92,0:26:44.30,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,您言重了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.61,0:26:47.45,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我们必当竭尽全力
Dialogue: 2,0:26:48.03,0:26:51.48,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我安排了小小的欢迎会
Dialogue: 2,0:26:52.81,0:26:56.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请在那和我细说你们的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:14.69,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,684)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(942,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:14.69,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,684)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(976,975)}练兵场
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.69,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,他们是我国的近卫师团
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.14,0:27:20.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们就是传闻的黑骑士
Dialogue: 2,0:27:31.83,0:27:34.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是赢不了修拉
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.89,0:27:38.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能指导一场我吗 大和队长
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.34,0:27:40.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 我…
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不会用剑的队长吗
Dialogue: 2,0:27:44.77,0:27:48.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘意外没什么了不起的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.74,0:27:51.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这点我之前已经证实了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:51.39,0:27:53.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们对客人太失礼了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:54.62,0:27:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长这里就让我来
Dialogue: 2,0:27:57.24,0:27:57.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:27:58.46,0:27:59.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,让他上吧
Dialogue: 2,0:28:01.72,0:28:04.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近卫师团长 修拉·塞尔彭坦
Dialogue: 2,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和队 真·飞鸟
Dialogue: 2,0:28:18.69,0:28:19.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.18,0:28:39.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么啊 「Freedom Killer」也没什么了不起的
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.44,0:28:41.00,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,这不还算好的吗
Dialogue: 2,0:28:43.42,0:28:45.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然阿斯兰·萨拉才是最强的
Dialogue: 2,0:28:46.70,0:28:47.50,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,你说谁啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:28:47.50,0:28:48.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别说了 真
Dialogue: 2,0:28:51.24,0:28:53.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,塞尔彭坦团长 请注意下分寸
Dialogue: 2,0:28:54.09,0:28:56.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只有有力量的人才能统治世界
Dialogue: 2,0:28:57.65,0:28:59.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你有这种力量吗
Dialogue: 2,0:29:01.11,0:29:03.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人们并不期望这样的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:29:04.80,0:29:05.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 2,0:29:06.98,0:29:08.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我非常期待在你的指挥下作战
Dialogue: 2,0:29:10.30,0:29:12.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你真的太没出息了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:12.96,0:29:15.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,早知如此 就让我上好了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:15.34,0:29:16.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别说了 阿格尼丝
Dialogue: 2,0:29:17.24,0:29:18.76,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝·吉本拉特
Dialogue: 2,0:29:19.84,0:29:21.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,月光女武神吗
Dialogue: 2,0:29:21.54,0:29:22.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:29:22.96,0:29:23.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.36,0:29:27.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,强者是美丽的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:37.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(968,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:37.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)}大厅
Dialogue: 2,0:29:40.29,0:29:43.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,贵国的繁荣 我早已有所耳闻
Dialogue: 2,0:29:44.70,0:29:49.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不论出身和年龄 优秀的人才我国都会任用
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.46,0:29:53.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也不管是自然人还是调整者
Dialogue: 2,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这都是奥费的安排
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.00,0:30:02.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能陪我跳一曲吗 公主
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我很乐意
Dialogue: 2,0:30:44.24,0:30:48.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 没想到黑骑士竟是那样的少爷小姐
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们是什么身份呢
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.78,0:30:52.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是调整者吗
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.13,0:30:55.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我猜也是 但是…
Dialogue: 2,0:30:56.28,0:30:56.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:57.70,0:31:00.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来实在不像是一支正规军
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.10,0:31:03.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要跳舞吗 队长
Dialogue: 2,0:31:05.04,0:31:07.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们可不是过来玩的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.39,0:31:14.89,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,别这样了 就知道招惹队长
Dialogue: 2,0:31:15.41,0:31:17.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么 我做错什么了
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.79,0:31:20.91,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,可是 你真的喜欢那个人吗
Dialogue: 2,0:31:21.50,0:31:24.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不打算随便妥协
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.54,0:31:26.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不像你
Dialogue: 2,0:31:27.08,0:31:28.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们在说什么
Dialogue: 2,0:31:28.31,0:31:31.10,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,没说什么 好啦要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:49.01,Screen,王城 蔷薇之庭,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,730)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(880,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:49.01,Screen,王城 蔷薇之庭,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,730)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(910,975)}蔷薇之庭
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.70,0:31:53.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哪怕是那么灿烂的花
Dialogue: 2,0:31:53.98,0:31:56.34,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,似乎也无法入你的眼呢
Dialogue: 2,0:31:59.44,0:32:01.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这花是为你而绽放的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:01.96,0:32:02.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请收下
Dialogue: 2,0:32:03.88,0:32:07.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常漂亮
Dialogue: 2,0:32:07.79,0:32:10.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了 如果你不喜欢的话
Dialogue: 2,0:32:11.04,0:32:13.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,玫瑰们就要在失望中枯萎了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.47,0:32:17.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,闻起来很香
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.32,0:32:21.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然还是笑容和你最配
Dialogue: 2,0:32:23.01,0:32:25.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也能理解你的烦恼
Dialogue: 2,0:32:25.71,0:32:26.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:32:26.71,0:32:27.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,任谁都是如此吧
Dialogue: 2,0:32:28.69,0:32:32.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对现在活着的人 寻找通往未来的人来说
Dialogue: 2,0:32:34.40,0:32:36.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人们不希望发生冲突
Dialogue: 2,0:32:36.77,0:32:39.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但另一方面冲突又不会消失
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.96,0:32:44.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,调整者和自然人虽都同是人
Dialogue: 2,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但可悲的是
Dialogue: 2,0:32:48.06,0:32:50.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人们会用这种微不足道的事作为斗争的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:32:51.88,0:32:52.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.20,0:32:54.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我是这么想的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:55.42,0:32:57.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,问题不在于这细微的差别对待
Dialogue: 2,0:32:57.88,0:33:00.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而在于社会真的做到了公平吗
Dialogue: 2,0:33:02.44,0:33:04.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,现在每个人都背负着战火的阴影
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.55,0:33:08.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不平和不满就会在这时候 丑陋地展示出来
Dialogue: 2,0:33:10.37,0:33:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为财富分配不公平
Dialogue: 2,0:33:12.54,0:33:14.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为生命的重量不一样
Dialogue: 2,0:33:14.66,0:33:16.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为从社会得不到正确的评价
Dialogue: 2,0:33:17.33,0:33:19.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以人们才会互相斗争
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.84,0:33:21.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果我们能呈现一个
Dialogue: 2,0:33:22.54,0:33:24.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,每个人都能被别人所需的公正平等的社会的话
Dialogue: 2,0:33:25.26,0:33:27.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就能跨越调整者和自然人之间的差异
Dialogue: 2,0:33:27.68,0:33:29.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,世界一定能向着更好的方向发展
Dialogue: 2,0:33:30.77,0:33:31.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是这么想的
Dialogue: 2,0:33:33.06,0:33:37.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常好的想法 也许确实是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:33:38.22,0:33:42.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,公主如此认可我 我就有自信做好宰相了
Dialogue: 2,0:33:46.37,0:33:49.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想创造一个没有贫困和歧视的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:33:49.80,0:33:51.73,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我就是为此而生的
Dialogue: 2,0:33:53.28,0:33:54.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 2,0:34:02.22,0:34:04.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 奥费阁下
Dialogue: 2,0:34:04.82,0:34:07.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舟车劳顿 我似乎有些疲惫了了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:07.62,0:34:09.53,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,请容许我先行告辞
Dialogue: 2,0:34:10.18,0:34:13.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常感谢您今天的款待
Dialogue: 2,0:34:20.23,0:34:21.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我给你带了夜宵
Dialogue: 2,0:34:22.42,0:34:24.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢 放那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:31.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,643)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(920,975)}千年号
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:31.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,643)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(956,975)}整备指挥所
Dialogue: 2,0:34:31.20,0:34:32.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗯 怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.43,0:34:35.70,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我觉得队长很可怜
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.58,0:34:40.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她在大家面前和别的男人亲热地跳舞
Dialogue: 2,0:34:40.78,0:34:43.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明队长接下来又要去危险的战场了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.94,0:34:46.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,不论如何 那都是工作需要
Dialogue: 2,0:34:47.08,0:34:48.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,您为什么不生气呢
Dialogue: 2,0:34:49.14,0:34:52.24,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,那个人是在利用队长的温柔
Dialogue: 2,0:34:55.06,0:34:58.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看看我 你也想回敬她 不是吗
Dialogue: 2,0:34:58.92,0:34:59.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:35:00.54,0:35:02.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思
Dialogue: 2,0:35:04.56,0:35:06.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么她就可以
Dialogue: 2,0:35:06.94,0:35:10.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的话就不会把心爱的人送往战场
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.94,0:35:13.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自己却只在安全的地方看着
Dialogue: 2,0:35:13.65,0:35:15.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:15.95,0:35:17.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你什么都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.27,0:35:31.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(689,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(966,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.27,0:35:31.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(689,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)}港口
Dialogue: 2,0:35:36.46,0:35:37.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,塔奥…阁下
Dialogue: 2,0:35:38.50,0:35:39.56,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,月亮真美
Dialogue: 2,0:35:40.14,0:35:44.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在黑暗中 平等地散发着安心至高的光
Dialogue: 2,0:35:45.14,0:35:46.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不这么认为吗
Dialogue: 2,0:35:46.88,0:35:48.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们改天再说
Dialogue: 2,0:35:48.73,0:35:51.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你有资格去追她吗
Dialogue: 2,0:35:52.82,0:35:55.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 你配不上她
Dialogue: 2,0:35:56.70,0:35:59.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,破坏 仇恨还有死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:35:59.86,0:36:02.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所创造全是这些东西
Dialogue: 2,0:36:02.61,0:36:03.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 2,0:36:07.98,0:36:09.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,杀死迪兰达尔议长后
Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.91,0:36:11.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你从这个世界上夺走了什么
Dialogue: 2,0:36:12.69,0:36:15.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,秩序 和平与没有冲突的社会
Dialogue: 2,0:36:15.92,0:36:18.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为了弥补人们失去的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:36:18.88,0:36:20.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你能够说 自己已经弥补了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.97,0:36:21.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 2,0:36:22.35,0:36:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,命运计划所呈现的世界再也无法实现
Dialogue: 2,0:36:26.61,0:36:28.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也知道的吧
Dialogue: 2,0:36:28.63,0:36:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家希望有人帮自己决定
Dialogue: 2,0:36:30.52,0:36:33.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自己能做的事 所期望的事
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.82,0:36:36.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她是指引着那个世界的光
Dialogue: 2,0:36:36.60,0:36:40.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,站在她身边的人 也是指引世界的人
Dialogue: 2,0:36:42.02,0:36:43.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的话就能做到
Dialogue: 2,0:36:44.58,0:36:47.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她所期望的世界 没有无止境的战争
Dialogue: 2,0:36:48.09,0:36:51.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能够创造一个安定与和谐的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:36:52.34,0:36:53.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这种事情…
Dialogue: 2,0:36:53.72,0:36:57.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你做不到 只会战斗的你做不到的
Dialogue: 2,0:36:57.90,0:36:58.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 2,0:37:00.23,0:37:03.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以和平到来时 你会怎么做
Dialogue: 2,0:37:04.34,0:37:07.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,用你沾满鲜血的手去牵起她的手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:17.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(818,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:17.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(858,975)}MS格纳库
Dialogue: 2,0:37:18.79,0:37:19.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.36,0:37:26.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不漂亮吗 没有魅力吗
Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.50,0:37:29.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么不能是我
Dialogue: 2,0:37:31.02,0:37:34.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你很美丽 月光女武神
Dialogue: 2,0:37:48.56,0:37:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真这个笨蛋 幼稚鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(900,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(932,975)}港区东亭
Dialogue: 2,0:38:01.38,0:38:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,睡不着吗
Dialogue: 2,0:38:03.46,0:38:04.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥费阁下
Dialogue: 2,0:38:04.64,0:38:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请把我当做月亮映下的影子
Dialogue: 2,0:38:13.39,0:38:16.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要怎么做才能把这一切都结束掉
Dialogue: 2,0:38:17.46,0:38:18.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:18.40,0:38:21.64,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,没有争执 在互相宽恕后一同生活
Dialogue: 2,0:38:22.11,0:38:24.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么会如此困难呢
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.06,0:38:31.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们的话 可以让这些结束的
Dialogue: 2,0:38:35.92,0:38:38.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我出现在此就是为了帮助你
Dialogue: 2,0:38:39.12,0:38:40.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仅仅为此
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.86,0:38:44.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:38:44.92,0:38:46.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是奥费·拉姆·塔奥
Dialogue: 2,0:38:47.38,0:38:51.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一个能与你结伴 恢复世界和平的人
Dialogue: 2,0:38:58.08,0:39:00.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有这样的事情吗 但…
Dialogue: 2,0:39:00.72,0:39:03.06,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我就是为此而生的
Dialogue: 2,0:39:03.94,0:39:05.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为了完成被赋予的使命
Dialogue: 2,0:39:06.50,0:39:08.34,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,而且 包括你
Dialogue: 2,0:39:16.91,0:39:21.24,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,祈祷吧孩子们 一起向新的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.00,0:39:23.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(880,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.00,0:39:23.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}奥拉的卧室
Dialogue: 2,0:39:21.98,0:39:24.08,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,遵循你们各自的命运
Dialogue: 2,0:39:24.87,0:39:27.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一切都按照当初决定的那样
Dialogue: 2,0:39:29.07,0:39:31.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,世界在等着你们
Dialogue: 2,0:39:32.22,0:39:35.67,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,这是我国所掌握的蓝色宇宙游击队的详细情况
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.51,0:39:36.43,Screen,王城内,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(918,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.51,0:39:36.43,Screen,王城内,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(954,975)}大会议事厅
Dialogue: 2,0:39:36.43,0:39:39.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米盖尔占据了埃尔多安的堡垒遗迹
Dialogue: 2,0:39:39.48,0:39:43.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,确认到他们通过地下通道出入欧亚境内
Dialogue: 2,0:39:44.30,0:39:47.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕基盘王国也有类似的情况吧
Dialogue: 2,0:39:48.32,0:39:49.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看来是呢
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.54,0:39:56.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 基盘王国部队优先考虑市民的疏散避难
Dialogue: 2,0:39:56.36,0:39:57.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,以及封锁敌人
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.37,0:40:01.76,Sub-CN,都翻了,0,0,0,,以逮捕和拘留米盖尔上校为目标
Dialogue: 2,0:40:02.49,0:40:07.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,劝降蓝色宇宙 最大限度减少人员伤亡
Dialogue: 2,0:40:07.86,0:40:10.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使号负责前线的指挥
Dialogue: 2,0:40:11.01,0:40:14.04,Sub-CN - up,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,蓝色宇宙一步也不许放入我国
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1150,975)}基盘王国欧亚联邦联邦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1184,975)}军事分界线
Dialogue: 2,0:40:14.98,0:40:18.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但罗盘也一样 只能进入埃尔多安地区
Dialogue: 2,0:40:18.82,0:40:19.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.78,0:40:25.58,Sub-CN,行为,0,0,0,,越过军事分界线者 我们将其视为侵略性为 展开攻击
Dialogue: 2,0:40:26.08,0:40:28.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不论是罗盘 还是基盘王国
Dialogue: 2,0:40:32.50,0:40:34.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,热源接近 数量为30以上
Dialogue: 2,0:40:34.90,0:40:38.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑暗标 反坦克弹 巴尔干炮 开始迎击
Dialogue: 2,0:40:43.72,0:40:47.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 阿格尼丝 希尔达负责解除敌方武装
Dialogue: 2,0:40:47.86,0:40:49.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我负责前往米盖尔的指挥所
Dialogue: 2,0:40:50.26,0:40:50.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.80,0:41:02.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(697,723)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}基盘王国领土内
Dialogue: 2,0:41:04.69,0:41:07.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敷岛队负责掩护Justice和Gyan
Dialogue: 2,0:41:07.51,0:41:08.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,秀景队跟随我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:39.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,642)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1038,975)}蓝色宇宙阵地
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:39.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,642)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1070,975)}防空设施
Dialogue: 2,0:41:41.05,0:41:41.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,退下
Dialogue: 2,0:41:47.77,0:41:49.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还有那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:57.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,686)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(952,975)}军事分界线内
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:57.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,686)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(986,975)}埃尔多安地区
Dialogue: 2,0:41:55.72,0:41:56.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(848,975)}王城内
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(882,975)}战时情报会议室
Dialogue: 2,0:42:13.42,0:42:14.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,何等的卑鄙
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,车辆及步兵部队撤退
Dialogue: 2,0:42:19.90,0:42:21.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是过分
Dialogue: 2,0:42:29.14,0:42:30.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 2,0:42:45.30,0:42:48.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迅速救助埃尔多安市区的伤员
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.69,0:42:49.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.09,0:42:55.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没办法 仅限埃尔多安地区 允许你们实施救助活动
Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.20,0:42:58.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:43:06.38,0:43:07.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,作战开始了
Dialogue: 2,0:43:08.58,0:43:10.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯 交给我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.28,0:43:11.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:43:11.47,0:43:12.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全杀光
Dialogue: 2,0:43:21.46,0:43:24.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,堕入黑暗吧 基拉大和
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1108,975)}蓝色宇宙阵地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1142,975)}据点
Dialogue: 2,0:43:47.10,0:43:47.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:48.50,0:43:48.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:58.48,0:43:59.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米盖尔?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.22,0:44:16.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 你怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:16.52,0:44:17.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我去抓捕米盖尔
Dialogue: 2,0:44:18.16,0:44:19.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 你掩护我
Dialogue: 2,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.90,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,啊 可是?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:21.52,0:44:22.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他要逃了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.37,0:44:27.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了 基拉 你正在接近分界线了 想什么呢
Dialogue: 2,0:44:28.22,0:44:30.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和队长机转向前往10H5G方向
Dialogue: 2,0:44:31.24,0:44:32.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正前往欧亚联邦领地内
Dialogue: 2,0:44:33.36,0:44:34.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 2,0:44:35.88,0:44:38.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你怎么了基…大和队长
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.22,0:44:40.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我发现了米盖尔 前去抓捕
Dialogue: 2,0:44:40.38,0:44:40.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 2,0:44:42.80,0:44:44.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,弗拉加上校 汇报情况
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:48.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1020,975)}欧亚联邦联邦领土内
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:48.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1056,975)}野战指挥所
Dialogue: 2,0:44:48.19,0:44:50.42,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,Freedom正接近军事分界线!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:50.73,0:44:53.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的 他不知道事前协议吗
Dialogue: 2,0:44:54.23,0:44:58.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,警告 Freedom 贵机正在接近欧亚联邦联邦领域
Dialogue: 2,0:44:58.28,0:45:00.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请立即改变前进方向
Dialogue: 2,0:45:00.40,0:45:01.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么要去欧亚联邦
Dialogue: 2,0:45:02.36,0:45:04.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的 总裁
Dialogue: 2,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom 请立即返回
Dialogue: 2,0:45:06.84,0:45:07.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.58,0:45:08.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,警告射击 发射
Dialogue: 2,0:45:08.98,0:45:09.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请等等
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:13.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1048,975)}欧亚联邦联邦国境
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:13.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1080,975)}防空阵地
Dialogue: 2,0:45:17.27,0:45:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还在抵抗吗?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:18.92,0:45:19.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 2,0:45:19.75,0:45:20.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉 住手
Dialogue: 2,0:45:20.69,0:45:21.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行的 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.00,0:45:23.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要在这里结束一切
Dialogue: 2,0:45:27.19,0:45:29.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是明确的侵略行为啊
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.59,0:45:32.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉 基拉 你听不见吗
Dialogue: 2,0:45:32.80,0:45:33.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是米盖尔
Dialogue: 2,0:45:33.91,0:45:36.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能在这里放他逃走
Dialogue: 2,0:45:37.56,0:45:39.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这不是我方的意志
Dialogue: 2,0:45:39.44,0:45:40.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只是大和队长个人的独断
Dialogue: 2,0:45:40.95,0:45:43.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一开始就有这打算 所以才把罗盘带进来的吧
Dialogue: 2,0:45:44.17,0:45:46.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那我们也要采用对策
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.52,0:45:47.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,既然如此 公主!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请等等 大和队长肯定有他的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:45:52.22,0:45:54.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他显然已经神志不清
Dialogue: 2,0:45:54.39,0:45:55.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,或者是反叛了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:55.60,0:45:56.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 2,0:45:56.68,0:45:58.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惜现状就是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:45:59.03,0:46:01.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘收拾不了场面的话
Dialogue: 2,0:46:01.82,0:46:03.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就请交给我们处理
Dialogue: 2,0:46:04.36,0:46:07.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,至今为止的外交努力都要白费了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:07.58,0:46:10.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果只因为一人的暴走 而出现人员伤亡的话
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.48,0:46:12.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可就本末倒置了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:12.83,0:46:13.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝大人
Dialogue: 2,0:46:18.33,0:46:19.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:20.54,0:46:22.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请阻止基拉…
Dialogue: 2,0:46:23.36,0:46:23.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.96,0:46:27.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是说准许对大和队长展开攻击 对吧?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:29.20,0:46:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:46:30.05,0:46:30.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝…
Dialogue: 2,0:46:31.25,0:46:32.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 克莱因总裁
Dialogue: 2,0:46:34.12,0:46:37.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有强电波干扰 全部信号都断了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:37.40,0:46:39.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是NJ达兹拉的干扰
Dialogue: 2,0:46:39.54,0:46:40.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这还没到实际使用的阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:46:40.72,0:46:42.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,量子溅射的抑制是怎么解决的?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:42.97,0:46:44.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这既不是欧亚联邦 也不是蓝色宇宙
Dialogue: 2,0:46:44.64,0:46:46.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜玛利亚机 紧急出战
Dialogue: 2,0:46:46.84,0:46:49.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还带着狙击枪和通信线
Dialogue: 2,0:46:49.11,0:46:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,听好了 修拉 履行你的使命吧
Dialogue: 2,0:46:52.26,0:46:52.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:46:53.31,0:46:54.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,2分钟解决
Dialogue: 2,0:46:54.64,0:46:57.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈 去死吧
Dialogue: 2,0:47:04.14,0:47:05.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑骑士?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:17.44,0:47:18.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,住手啊 为什么!
Dialogue: 2,0:47:19.18,0:47:21.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么?你看看周围吧
Dialogue: 2,0:47:27.60,0:47:28.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 2,0:47:29.93,0:47:31.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,杀死你
Dialogue: 2,0:47:32.86,0:47:37.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉啦 拉克丝公主说她已经不要你了
Dialogue: 2,0:47:51.61,0:47:52.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉
Dialogue: 2,0:47:58.66,0:47:59.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 2,0:48:03.04,0:48:03.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 怎么啦?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.48,0:48:09.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别妨碍我啊
Dialogue: 2,0:48:12.89,0:48:14.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不长记性啊
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.04,0:48:18.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,都证明过你不是我的对手啦
Dialogue: 2,0:48:25.06,0:48:25.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.12,0:48:32.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这些家伙…果然
Dialogue: 2,0:48:33.13,0:48:35.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是陷阱 大天使号前进
Dialogue: 2,0:48:35.57,0:48:38.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,马兹机 赫尔贝尔特机掩护我方撤退
Dialogue: 2,0:48:38.90,0:48:41.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射信号弹 前去救援基拉等人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.94,0:48:47.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(944,975)}欧亚联邦联邦领土内
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.94,0:48:47.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(978,975)}战术核导弹阵地
Dialogue: 2,0:48:47.37,0:48:49.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,密码
Dialogue: 2,0:48:57.85,0:49:00.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,监测到疑似MS热源 距离1万7千
Dialogue: 2,0:49:03.81,0:49:04.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑骑士?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:05.48,0:49:09.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这里可是欧亚联邦大后方哦 他们来这地方干什么
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.22,0:49:11.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊 被看见啦
Dialogue: 2,0:49:12.05,0:49:15.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没问题 反正也是要处理掉的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:21.74,0:49:25.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,监测到疑似导弹飞行物的热源 现在显示光学影像
Dialogue: 2,0:49:27.43,0:49:27.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那个是…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:28.60,0:49:33.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是GLCM Mark72 巡航战术核导弹 欧亚联邦军方发射的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:36.15,0:49:38.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑骑士2机正向本舰接近
Dialogue: 2,0:49:40.46,0:49:40.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,难道…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:41.29,0:49:41.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:43.97,0:49:45.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,来自本国的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:45.98,0:49:49.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已确认是从欧亚联邦领土内发射的战术核导弹
Dialogue: 2,0:49:51.13,0:49:51.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目标呢?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.53,0:49:53.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是这里
Dialogue: 2,0:49:53.65,0:49:55.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向千年号发送紧急通话
Dialogue: 2,0:49:55.84,0:49:57.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 仍然无法通信
Dialogue: 2,0:49:59.14,0:50:00.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本舰被锁定了
Dialogue: 2,0:50:04.48,0:50:06.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主炮 1号 2号中弹!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:06.62,0:50:10.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对空战斗 火神炮 反坦克弹 开火
Dialogue: 2,0:50:10.44,0:50:11.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,损伤控制 开始
Dialogue: 2,0:50:12.66,0:50:14.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 给我沉下去吧
Dialogue: 2,0:50:15.42,0:50:18.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反正结果也一样 真麻烦
Dialogue: 2,0:50:29.18,0:50:31.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,火神炮 地狱标 无法使用
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.97,0:50:34.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,多数疑似导弹的热源正在接近
Dialogue: 2,0:50:35.13,0:50:36.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,散布对空弹头
Dialogue: 2,0:50:36.38,0:50:37.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,右舵 全速
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.36,0:50:46.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,激光不管用
Dialogue: 2,0:50:46.81,0:50:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是传说中的费姆科技装甲吗!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.82,0:50:52.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 见过了就去死吧
Dialogue: 2,0:50:58.10,0:51:00.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,战域坐标 020威士忌138
Dialogue: 2,0:51:01.36,0:51:01.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:51:04.38,0:51:06.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,情况怎么样了 真
Dialogue: 2,0:51:06.71,0:51:09.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,误射?这解释得通吗!那可是核武!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:10.03,0:51:11.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,到底是哪个笨蛋干的
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 不受这边的控制
Dialogue: 2,0:51:15.42,0:51:18.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,少将 基盘王宫发来了直接通信
Dialogue: 2,0:51:18.89,0:51:19.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,连上
Dialogue: 2,0:51:26.81,0:51:29.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全员撤退 也请向全市发送紧急避难通知
Dialogue: 2,0:51:30.28,0:51:32.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,尽可能让市民前往地下避难
Dialogue: 2,0:51:34.48,0:51:35.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这边请
Dialogue: 2,0:51:35.78,0:51:36.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.57,0:51:37.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请快些
Dialogue: 2,0:51:47.21,0:51:49.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰桥关闭 急速潜航
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.57,0:51:52.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好的 打开排口 千年号 急速潜航!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:05.48,0:52:05.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是那个吧
Dialogue: 2,0:52:19.06,0:52:20.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:52:24.22,0:52:25.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,第二发改变了航道
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.14,0:52:26.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 2,0:52:27.35,0:52:29.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快躲避 露娜玛利亚 已经无法狙击了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:30.59,0:52:32.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不试试怎么知道
Dialogue: 2,0:52:35.30,0:52:37.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,准备完成立即出发
Dialogue: 2,0:52:54.14,0:52:55.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,给我打中
Dialogue: 2,0:53:35.39,0:53:36.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这些家伙到底…
Dialogue: 2,0:53:41.79,0:53:44.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盘机体…可恶
Dialogue: 2,0:53:46.70,0:53:48.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主炮 火神炮 全灭
Dialogue: 2,0:53:49.02,0:53:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,运作停止 火势正往弹药库蔓延
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.79,0:53:55.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,切断引擎 放弃战舰 全员离舰!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:56.10,0:53:57.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全员撤退!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:04.77,0:54:06.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,做好冲击准备!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:13.27,0:54:16.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大姐头不在 可以大展身手啦
Dialogue: 2,0:54:20.07,0:54:21.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啧 这就是怪物…
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.02,0:54:23.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起 大姐头
Dialogue: 2,0:54:27.16,0:54:29.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,马兹 赫尔贝尔特
Dialogue: 2,0:54:58.97,0:55:00.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们竟敢!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:07.07,0:55:08.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.90,0:55:18.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,终于到了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:55:14.66,0:55:16.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,时限到了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:55:21.10,0:55:22.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使号…
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.58,0:55:24.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别东张西望的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:42.70,0:55:43.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抓住我手 小子
Dialogue: 2,0:55:49.74,0:55:49.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 2,0:55:59.74,0:56:00.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你小子打不赢的
Dialogue: 2,0:56:01.57,0:56:02.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:56:05.24,0:56:07.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为那就是你的命运啊
Dialogue: 2,0:56:07.89,0:56:08.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 2,0:56:18.57,0:56:20.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那家伙由我来下手
Dialogue: 2,0:56:27.38,0:56:28.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.05,0:56:32.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:56:45.90,0:56:46.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:56:50.72,0:56:51.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有一手
Dialogue: 2,0:56:51.28,0:56:51.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,行得通
Dialogue: 2,0:57:00.22,0:57:00.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.14,0:57:01.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰?
Dialogue: 2,0:57:10.76,0:57:12.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 让你久等啦
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.46,0:57:14.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好慢哦
Dialogue: 2,0:57:25.41,0:57:26.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰萨拉吗
Dialogue: 2,0:57:28.81,0:57:30.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 时间到了
Dialogue: 2,0:57:33.42,0:57:34.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你来吗
Dialogue: 2,0:57:36.31,0:57:38.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我跟你走
Dialogue: 2,0:57:42.20,0:57:44.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝…为什么
Dialogue: 2,0:57:44.50,0:57:45.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们快逃 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:57:45.75,0:57:47.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使号的人也一起
Dialogue: 2,0:58:19.03,0:58:19.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 2,0:58:20.77,0:58:21.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:34.54,0:58:34.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:40.07,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}阿斯哈家所有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:40.07,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}奥布领地晓岛
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.90,0:58:40.12,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,埃尔多安悲剧4天后 现场的辐射量仍很高
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.41,0:58:44.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(896,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.41,0:58:44.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(928,975)}秘密海中船坞
Dialogue: 2,0:58:40.54,0:58:44.29,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,关系主要国的救援行动进展得并不乐观
Dialogue: 2,0:58:45.05,0:58:46.97,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,NJC设施再次运作
Dialogue: 2,0:58:47.46,0:58:50.94,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,与此同时 地上再次喷涌出的噩梦 使世界陷入恐慌
Dialogue: 2,0:58:51.41,0:58:54.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,抗议的声音正在日益增多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.04,0:58:54.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(978,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.04,0:58:54.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1012,975)}海中港口
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:56.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(982,975)}奥布联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:56.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1012,975)}代表首长官邸
Dialogue: 2,0:58:55.08,0:58:59.94,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,第二爆炸地点东1.5公里处 发现了疑似大天使号的残骸
Dialogue: 2,0:59:00.45,0:59:05.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仍未发现Freedom和Justice以及其他参与作战的MS
Dialogue: 2,0:59:06.06,0:59:08.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我方的呼叫也没有得到回应
Dialogue: 2,0:59:08.92,0:59:11.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有可能全部被卷入了爆炸当中
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.77,0:59:16.73,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}基盘王国卫星基地宇域 华纳海姆级行星间宇宙战舰古尔韦格
Dialogue: 2,0:59:11.78,0:59:14.34,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那么克莱因总裁没事吧
Dialogue: 2,0:59:15.28,0:59:17.70,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗯 根据千年号的报告
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.90,0:59:19.82,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(952,975)}卫星基地内
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.90,0:59:19.82,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(988,975)}船锚
Dialogue: 2,0:59:18.22,0:59:20.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,她和基盘的高官一起撤离了
Dialogue: 2,0:59:21.91,0:59:22.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T.的联系呢
Dialogue: 2,0:59:23.82,0:59:24.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,并没有
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.61,0:59:25.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 2,0:59:26.39,0:59:28.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欧亚联邦发来了严重的抗议
Dialogue: 2,0:59:29.34,0:59:33.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,说是全怪大和队长破坏协定 越过军事分界线
Dialogue: 2,0:59:34.36,0:59:37.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那也不能成为发射核导弹的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:59:37.90,0:59:40.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那可是对全人类的背叛行为啊
Dialogue: 2,0:59:41.07,0:59:43.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和队长的事我也无法接受
Dialogue: 2,0:59:43.68,0:59:46.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仅仅是看报告 有太多地方说不清楚
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.20,0:59:49.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,根本弄不清楚发生了什么
Dialogue: 2,0:59:49.54,0:59:51.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真实都埋藏在黑暗之中
Dialogue: 2,0:59:51.52,0:59:55.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,除非大和队长或者米盖尔亲口说明…
Dialogue: 2,0:59:56.01,1:00:00.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没法追责任何人 那可真是方便啊
Dialogue: 2,1:00:00.95,1:00:02.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你想说什么?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:02.93,1:00:07.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想说的是 大和队长的行动真的是他的一意孤行吗
Dialogue: 2,1:00:08.15,1:00:12.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本次事件是P.L.A.N.T.介入欧亚联邦领地的绝好机…
Dialogue: 2,1:00:12.14,1:00:13.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请停止你的刁难
Dialogue: 2,1:00:13.92,1:00:15.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉是会这么做的人吗
Dialogue: 2,1:00:17.13,1:00:18.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐
Dialogue: 2,1:00:18.85,1:00:19.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:00:20.23,1:00:24.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么我国从此以后 将不再与罗盘进行交流
Dialogue: 2,1:00:24.61,1:00:28.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们也是 绝不会忍受这样的无端猜疑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:39.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1016,975)}奥布联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:39.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1052,975)}淤能碁吕岛
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(842,975)}千年号
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(948,975)}军官室
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1050,975)}真的房间
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.23,1:00:42.26,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,不想承认
Dialogue: 2,1:00:48.78,1:00:50.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么还不回来啊
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.46,1:00:52.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真个傻瓜
Dialogue: 2,1:00:53.18,1:00:56.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊 果然是基盘王国吗
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.37,1:00:59.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,从干扰的时机来看 有92%的可能性有幕后黑手
Dialogue: 2,1:00:59.77,1:01:00.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是黑色骑士搞的鬼
Dialogue: 2,1:01:01.36,1:01:04.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为叫黑色骑士 所以是黑的…
Dialogue: 2,1:01:06.07,1:01:10.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么核攻击也是基盘王国发动的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:01:10.72,1:01:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我们没有办法证明这点
Dialogue: 2,1:01:14.06,1:01:16.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号既没有收到回港命令 也没有配备MS
Dialogue: 2,1:01:16.76,1:01:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使号也被击沉 船员的生存几率很小
Dialogue: 2,1:01:20.25,1:01:21.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,究竟如何呢
Dialogue: 2,1:01:22.41,1:01:25.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群人会这么轻易地死掉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.53,1:01:28.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(844,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.53,1:01:28.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(872,975)}海底港内研究室
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.08,1:01:29.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,包括基盘王国 埃尔多安地区在内推测出现死者五万
Dialogue: 2,1:01:29.87,1:01:33.11,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,伤者 失踪者超过十万人
Dialogue: 2,1:01:33.51,1:01:37.21,Sub-CN - up,调轴-跟电视一起关,0,0,0,,欧亚联邦军准备报仇 命令全军时刻准备出击…
Dialogue: 2,1:01:37.85,1:01:39.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们两个都没事了吗
Dialogue: 2,1:01:39.97,1:01:41.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 2,1:01:44.84,1:01:45.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 2,1:01:45.87,1:01:49.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目前罗盘的活动已被冻结
Dialogue: 2,1:01:52.14,1:01:54.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘被冻结是真的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:01:55.05,1:01:57.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 虽然卡嘉莉努力争取过了
Dialogue: 2,1:01:58.18,1:02:00.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但现在全世界都在非难罗盘
Dialogue: 2,1:02:01.95,1:02:03.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群家伙 该死
Dialogue: 2,1:02:04.41,1:02:07.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,唯一幸存的千年号现在停泊在奥布
Dialogue: 2,1:02:08.51,1:02:10.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还没有通知他们我们的情况
Dialogue: 2,1:02:11.83,1:02:12.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝呢?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:13.26,1:02:16.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她好像坐基盘王国的穿梭机安全离开了
Dialogue: 2,1:02:17.58,1:02:20.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她背叛了我们
Dialogue: 2,1:02:26.83,1:02:29.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,终端调查到了这些信息
Dialogue: 2,1:02:31.03,1:02:33.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是奥拉女帝?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:33.91,1:02:38.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是她19年前在孟德尔基因研究所的样子
Dialogue: 2,1:02:38.53,1:02:39.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,19年前
Dialogue: 2,1:02:41.53,1:02:45.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她的研究课题是创造出超越调整者的人种
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.86,1:02:52.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,846)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3F&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}轨道间全方位战略炮『镇魂曲』
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.43,1:02:53.31,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,偏转线圈1号 3号 6号完成朝预定地点的展开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.66,1:02:56.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1168,975)}基盘王国卫星基地内
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.66,1:02:56.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1200,975)}控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:02:53.85,1:02:56.02,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目标准星修正 +2.3
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.50,1:02:59.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}基盘王国军\N华纳海姆级行星间宇宙战舰 『古尔韦格』机库
Dialogue: 2,1:02:56.57,1:02:59.89,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,距离「镇魂曲」发射临界还有T-60
Dialogue: 2,1:03:00.34,1:03:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系统工作正常
Dialogue: 2,1:03:02.56,1:03:07.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕一切都在奥拉 在他们的计划之中
Dialogue: 2,1:03:11.84,1:03:12.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,核攻击也是
Dialogue: 2,1:03:14.07,1:03:17.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,至少也能以他们发起核攻击为借口
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.00,1:03:19.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」发射准备结束
Dialogue: 2,1:03:20.44,1:03:21.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,赐予我神的祝福
Dialogue: 2,1:03:24.33,1:03:27.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们以此为借口进攻欧亚联邦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.15,1:03:30.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1048,975)}欧亚联邦联邦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.15,1:03:30.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1082,975)}首都
Dialogue: 2,1:03:44.46,1:03:45.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐
Dialogue: 2,1:03:46.46,1:03:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,萨拉上校立刻前往控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:03:49.24,1:03:50.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,赶紧收集情报
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.59,1:03:53.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,固定连接罗盘司令部以及奥布政府的线路
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}奥布联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1020,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1154,975)}海底控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:03:54.70,1:03:55.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,莫斯科…
Dialogue: 2,1:03:56.40,1:03:59.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是基盘王国的复仇? 已经开始了?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:00.78,1:04:02.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,核… 攻击?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:02.95,1:04:04.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不对 这是…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:07.86,1:04:09.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(784,975)}奥布联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(970,975)}代表首长官邸内
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1156,975)}战时情报会议室
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.65,1:04:12.72,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」不是被解体了吗
Dialogue: 2,1:04:12.86,1:04:15.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T.这是赤裸裸地违反停战协议
Dialogue: 2,1:04:16.21,1:04:18.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这样的复仇 我们绝不能姑息
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.57,1:04:21.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大总统…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:21.34,1:04:23.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你说什么 立刻连接上
Dialogue: 2,1:04:24.94,1:04:29.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为自然人发射的仇恨的核弹 我们被逐出了地面
Dialogue: 2,1:04:31.25,1:04:33.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们只渴望和平与安定的愿望
Dialogue: 2,1:04:34.71,1:04:37.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又一次被顽固愚蠢的自然人践踏
Dialogue: 2,1:04:38.28,1:04:38.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.14,1:04:43.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我国接受了前任P.L.A.N.T.评议会会长
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.27,1:04:44.77,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1148,975)}基盘王国卫星基地内
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.27,1:04:44.77,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1180,975)}司令官室
Dialogue: 2,1:04:44.40,1:04:47.73,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,吉尔伯特·迪兰达尔 作为国策所提倡的「命运计划」
Dialogue: 2,1:04:49.14,1:04:52.27,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,建立在基因基础上 完全公平且平等的社会
Dialogue: 2,1:04:53.14,1:04:57.19,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,通过接受刻于自己基因中的使命
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.07,1:05:00.08,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(904,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.07,1:05:00.08,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(938,975)}湍津姬海岸
Dialogue: 2,1:04:58.02,1:04:59.83,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们克服了贫困
Dialogue: 2,1:05:00.29,1:05:02.21,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,在先前的大战中获得独立
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(892,975)}奥布联合首长国
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}淤能碁吕岛「辉夜」
Dialogue: 2,1:05:02.93,1:05:05.01,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,让世界看到了我们奇迹般的复兴
Dialogue: 2,1:05:05.55,1:05:09.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,然而 怠惰的人们看不惯我们的成就
Dialogue: 2,1:05:10.24,1:05:14.30,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,他们否定进化 嫉妒他人 无法忘记过去的仇恨
Dialogue: 2,1:05:14.65,1:05:17.03,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,怀着丑陋的情感互相残杀
Dialogue: 2,1:05:17.89,1:05:19.66,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,住在名为地球的安宁之地
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.97,1:05:22.81,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1064,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高评议会楼内
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.97,1:05:22.81,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1094,975)}情报官办公室
Dialogue: 2,1:05:20.01,1:05:23.14,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,却又和贪婪地消耗这份恩惠的寄生虫一般
Dialogue: 2,1:05:24.15,1:05:25.13,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们想发问
Dialogue: 2,1:05:25.73,1:05:30.28,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,为什么我们必须和这些蒙昧之辈一同前进
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:30.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(570,975)}扎夫特
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:30.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(606,975)}纳兹卡级高速战舰『布克哈特』舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:34.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(828,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:34.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp0\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(860,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高评议会大楼前
Dialogue: 2,1:05:32.34,1:05:34.36,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,住在P.L.A.N.T.的调整者们啊
Dialogue: 2,1:05:35.27,1:05:36.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们是你们的同胞
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.84,1:05:38.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们和我们一样
Dialogue: 2,1:05:39.08,1:05:41.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,都是将人类的进化带向未来的人种
Dialogue: 2,1:05:43.14,1:05:47.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们也是基因编辑而诞生的究极调整者 超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:05:43.14,1:05:47.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\pos(1400,992)}Accord
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.03,1:05:54.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们刻在基因里的使命 就是作为人类的调停者引领世界
Dialogue: 2,1:05:55.52,1:05:57.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们就是为此而诞生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.84,1:06:00.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1172,975)}基盘王国卫星基地内
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.84,1:06:00.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1204,975)}贵宾室
Dialogue: 2,1:05:58.57,1:06:03.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,你们引领者之一的拉克丝·克莱因总裁也是我们的同胞
Dialogue: 2,1:06:04.27,1:06:07.94,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,她作为人类的引领者 现在也和我们站在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.19,1:06:11.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(898,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.19,1:06:11.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(928,975)}马尔奇欧的教会
Dialogue: 2,1:06:09.21,1:06:11.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们的意志即是她的意志
Dialogue: 2,1:06:11.79,1:06:13.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们的愿望也是她的愿望
Dialogue: 2,1:06:14.95,1:06:17.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起前进吧 调整者的同胞们
Dialogue: 2,1:06:18.55,1:06:21.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,旧人类掀起的矛盾和暴虐的时代已经结束了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:23.61,1:06:25.78,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们向地球上所有国家发出通告
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.45,1:06:26.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1092,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高评议会
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.45,1:06:26.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1120,975)}议场
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.48,1:06:30.72,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻解除武装 承认命运计划并予以执行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:29.88,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(850,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:29.88,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(880,975)}议长事务室
Dialogue: 2,1:06:31.66,1:06:33.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们有5天时间考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.34,1:06:37.63,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(746,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.34,1:06:37.63,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(778,975)}地下紧急逃生艇
Dialogue: 2,1:06:33.60,1:06:37.23,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此外 对于不接受我们的势力
Dialogue: 2,1:06:37.84,1:06:42.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,将以拉克丝·克莱因之名 降下「镇魂曲」的制裁
Dialogue: 2,1:06:43.39,1:06:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们的头上必将降下米吉多之火吧
Dialogue: 2,1:06:43.39,1:06:46.00,PS,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs44}位于以色列的古城 启示录预言中灭世之战的地方
Dialogue: 2,1:06:46.96,1:06:48.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 2,1:06:49.86,1:06:50.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:06:52.56,1:06:53.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,议长到舰桥了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.48,1:06:58.13,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,玖尔女士 卡纳巴前代表 多谢相助
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:07:01.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}Terminal 所属\N永恒级MS专用母舰『永恒』舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:06:59.02,1:07:03.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但是我无法这样坐视国内的骚乱发展下去
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.90,1:07:05.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白 议长
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.08,1:07:10.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,最坏的情况 「镇魂曲」的准星会再次指向P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:10.77,1:07:13.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,现在必须看清形势 暂时隐藏身形
Dialogue: 2,1:07:14.54,1:07:15.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,相关的准备呢?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:16.61,1:07:18.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然算不上万无一失
Dialogue: 2,1:07:19.51,1:07:24.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,废弃波阿斯里有拉克丝大人嘱托的用于抵抗的补充设施
Dialogue: 2,1:07:25.13,1:07:25.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们将去往那里…
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.86,1:07:27.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:28.34,1:07:31.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,让你一个人等这么久真是抱歉 公主
Dialogue: 2,1:07:32.20,1:07:33.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真想表明歉意的话
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.25,1:07:38.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,希望能尽快让我回去
Dialogue: 2,1:07:39.38,1:07:39.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,回去?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:40.86,1:07:43.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你本来的归宿就是这里
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.06,1:07:47.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这也是你母亲的意志
Dialogue: 2,1:07:48.80,1:07:49.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母亲的?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.00,1:07:57.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,命运计划依据基因筛选人类 根据适应性决定使命
Dialogue: 2,1:07:58.67,1:08:03.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迪兰达尔和奥拉创造了管理这个体系 引领人类的人们
Dialogue: 2,1:08:04.38,1:08:05.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那就是超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:08:09.44,1:08:11.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是为了普罗大众而生
Dialogue: 2,1:08:12.30,1:08:15.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为了被所有人们爱戴 为他们指明方向
Dialogue: 2,1:08:17.09,1:08:19.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是为此创造出了你
Dialogue: 2,1:08:20.65,1:08:22.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,创造了… 我
Dialogue: 2,1:08:23.77,1:08:28.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,然后 他们超越者最首要的关键就是奥费·拉姆·塔奥
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.95,1:08:30.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,以及拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:08:32.80,1:08:33.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:08:35.01,1:08:39.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们两人是应该站在所有人类顶点的人
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.02,1:08:43.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是最终拼图的一角
Dialogue: 2,1:08:44.60,1:08:48.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我和你要一起统治这个世界
Dialogue: 2,1:08:49.66,1:08:50.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,感受得到吧
Dialogue: 2,1:08:52.28,1:08:54.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起? 和你?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:55.61,1:08:59.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们的命运就是互相吸引 结为连理
Dialogue: 2,1:09:01.25,1:09:03.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以他们抢走了拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:09:04.10,1:09:06.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为他们的计划需要她
Dialogue: 2,1:09:08.99,1:09:09.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:09:14.96,1:09:18.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我爱的人不是你
Dialogue: 2,1:09:20.79,1:09:22.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在想基拉·大和的事情吗
Dialogue: 2,1:09:23.72,1:09:26.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遗憾的是 他已经不在这个世上了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:27.76,1:09:30.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是你下命令攻击他的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:09:33.78,1:09:34.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:09:35.05,1:09:38.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 对今后的世界而言 他已经没有用了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.28,1:09:41.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不是…
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.14,1:09:44.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不是因为需要才爱他
Dialogue: 2,1:09:45.70,1:09:47.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而是因为爱他才需要他的
Dialogue: 2,1:09:48.90,1:09:51.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,够了 别再说这种自然人一样的胡话了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:53.14,1:09:53.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我出击了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.66,1:09:57.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 英格利特 母亲和公主就拜托了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:59.83,1:10:03.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,根据情报 目前P.L.A.N.T.正处于军队领导的武装政变中
Dialogue: 2,1:10:04.53,1:10:05.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,详情还不清楚
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.03,1:10:08.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我们无法联络到议长以下的评议会成员
Dialogue: 2,1:10:10.08,1:10:12.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我们现在无计可施
Dialogue: 2,1:10:12.90,1:10:14.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们既没有MS也没有战舰
Dialogue: 2,1:10:15.35,1:10:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们在这里就跟死人没有差别
Dialogue: 2,1:10:20.34,1:10:24.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,据我推测 超越者可以读取我们的内心
Dialogue: 2,1:10:25.58,1:10:29.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕还可以影响人的精神吧
Dialogue: 2,1:10:30.22,1:10:31.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以队长才…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.49,1:10:37.12,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(872,975)}地球联合军
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.49,1:10:37.12,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(904,975)}恩底弥翁基地
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.91,1:10:38.46,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,基盘王国在地球各国完全投降之后
Dialogue: 2,1:10:38.87,1:10:41.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,劝告各国解除武装 施行命运计划
Dialogue: 2,1:10:42.66,1:10:46.90,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,并声明若不听从劝告 将立即发射「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:50.47,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}小野鸣岛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:50.47,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(916,975)}战死者慰灵公园
Dialogue: 2,1:10:47.39,1:10:51.81,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此时 将不允许任何平民避难
Dialogue: 2,1:10:56.13,1:11:00.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们去救拉克丝吧 除此之外别无他法
Dialogue: 2,1:11:00.79,1:11:04.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们需要她的话语 来破除僵局 阻止P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:06.97,1:11:07.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:09.03,1:11:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉君?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:10.21,1:11:11.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反正都是一样的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.97,1:11:13.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管我们做什么
Dialogue: 2,1:11:14.17,1:11:15.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发现扎夫特舰队
Dialogue: 2,1:11:15.62,1:11:18.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我方舰队的右翼 左翼 前方展开队形
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(606,975)}地球联合军
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(642,975)}阿伽门农级母舰『贝奥武夫』舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:11:18.56,1:11:20.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,舰队左翼受到炮击
Dialogue: 2,1:11:21.13,1:11:22.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各舰向右回避
Dialogue: 2,1:11:22.92,1:11:23.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,右翼也受到炮击
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.18,1:11:30.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能靠得太紧 会受到「镇魂曲」的正面攻击
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.64,1:11:44.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,到头来还是重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.90,1:11:48.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那样挣扎 迷茫 战斗过来
Dialogue: 2,1:11:48.65,1:11:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,战斗 不断地战斗
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.31,1:11:53.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是什么都没有改变
Dialogue: 2,1:11:54.47,1:11:57.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为我做错了吗
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.34,1:11:59.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.44,1:12:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以拉克丝才抛弃我 选择了他
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.70,1:12:05.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是错的啊
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.40,1:12:09.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝希望的东西 我一个都给不了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:09.30,1:12:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别说和平了 甚至无法让她露出笑颜
Dialogue: 2,1:12:13.85,1:12:18.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我无法让她幸福 所以她背叛了我
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别说些没用的牢骚
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.30,1:12:26.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只知道自己 自己的
Dialogue: 2,1:12:26.40,1:12:30.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一点都没考虑过她的心情吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.45,1:12:33.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,够了 这么讨厌战斗的话
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.20,1:12:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就在这里畏畏缩缩地烂掉吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:35.40,1:12:41.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你懂什么 就这么说我
Dialogue: 2,1:12:44.85,1:12:47.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你打算一个人战斗吗
Dialogue: 2,1:12:47.40,1:12:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能怎么办 你们太弱了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:50.75,1:12:52.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:52.35,1:12:55.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你就打算一个人背负世界
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.30,1:12:57.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不合心意就放任不管吗
Dialogue: 2,1:12:57.75,1:12:59.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是了不起的英雄啊
Dialogue: 2,1:12:59.35,1:13:01.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 2,1:13:05.90,1:13:08.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,住手 阿斯兰 放开队长
Dialogue: 2,1:13:11.15,1:13:12.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 2,1:13:12.45,1:13:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,让他们打吧
Dialogue: 2,1:13:14.60,1:13:19.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,朋友就是该帮自以为是的混蛋看清现实
Dialogue: 2,1:13:19.75,1:13:21.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必须…
Dialogue: 2,1:13:21.10,1:13:23.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必须由我来做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:23.40,1:13:26.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不喜欢 但是拼了命地做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:26.00,1:13:27.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么不说出来
Dialogue: 2,1:13:27.95,1:13:30.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么不拜托别人
Dialogue: 2,1:13:30.45,1:13:34.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一个人能做到什么
Dialogue: 2,1:13:40.50,1:13:42.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想见拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:13:44.25,1:13:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:13:46.00,1:13:49.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明我只希望你能在我身边欢笑而已
Dialogue: 2,1:13:49.80,1:13:55.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我到底应该怎么做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:55.65,1:14:00.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不过一会没见 拉克丝的变化还真大啊
Dialogue: 2,1:14:00.95,1:14:04.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,像这样不去做就无法幸福
Dialogue: 2,1:14:04.10,1:14:07.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,做不到就不行之类的
Dialogue: 2,1:14:07.05,1:14:11.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道的拉克丝可不会说这种话
Dialogue: 2,1:14:13.80,1:14:18.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝希望世界和平
Dialogue: 2,1:14:18.05,1:14:23.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 她也没想着让人把和平像礼物一样送给她吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:23.80,1:14:28.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她希望的难道不是和她一起朝这个目标前进的同伴吗
Dialogue: 2,1:14:28.70,1:14:32.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一步一步 就算步子很小
Dialogue: 2,1:14:32.60,1:14:36.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝现在还这么想吗
Dialogue: 2,1:14:36.65,1:14:40.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不安的话 就见个面问问吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:40.35,1:14:43.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,走吧 基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:14:43.05,1:14:45.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,去救拉克丝吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:45.00,1:14:46.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们一起
Dialogue: 2,1:14:46.75,1:14:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有些事情必须说出来
Dialogue: 2,1:14:57.15,1:14:58.80,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我分析了航迹
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.59,1:15:01.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(690,975)}L1 宙域
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.59,1:15:01.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(728,975)}终端据点卫星『工厂』
Dialogue: 2,1:14:58.80,1:15:02.50,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,确定了基盘王国的穿梭机前往的宙域
Dialogue: 2,1:15:02.50,1:15:06.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,综合奥布的情报 拉克丝恐怕在…
Dialogue: 2,1:15:06.20,1:15:09.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿耳忒弥斯要塞 棘手了啊
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.45,1:15:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,利用托利和布鲁的量子网络可以确定拉克丝的位置
Dialogue: 2,1:15:13.85,1:15:17.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只要接近就能够确定位置对吧
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.30,1:15:21.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要是拉克丝还带着的话
Dialogue: 2,1:15:21.50,1:15:23.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰船要怎么办呢
Dialogue: 2,1:15:23.30,1:15:26.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们也没有能正式战斗的MS
Dialogue: 2,1:15:26.45,1:15:29.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰船的话 说不定可以弄到
Dialogue: 2,1:15:29.55,1:15:32.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然方法有点粗鲁
Dialogue: 2,1:15:32.30,1:15:35.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我或许可以提供MS
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.92,1:15:39.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}晓岛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.92,1:15:39.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}地下极密机库
Dialogue: 2,1:15:37.60,1:15:39.60,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,阿斯哈代表托付给我们的
Dialogue: 2,1:15:39.60,1:15:44.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本来用于新型融合炉和新装备的性能评测实验
Dialogue: 2,1:15:44.30,1:15:48.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没想到会出现这种事态
Dialogue: 2,1:15:48.10,1:15:49.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:15:49.20,1:15:50.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:15:50.70,1:15:53.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然驱动装置和武器装备还是老样子
Dialogue: 2,1:15:53.60,1:15:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是操作系统更新成了最新版
Dialogue: 2,1:15:57.00,1:16:01.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然和黑色骑士对抗还是有些没底
Dialogue: 2,1:16:01.15,1:16:07.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 有了这台机体 怎么会输给那种家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:16:27.55,1:16:29.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 2,1:16:32.50,1:16:35.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰长 是喷射攻击
Dialogue: 2,1:16:35.50,1:16:37.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 2,1:16:37.40,1:16:40.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请船员立刻离开舰船
Dialogue: 2,1:16:40.00,1:16:43.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,重复 紧急警报 紧急警报
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.30,1:16:45.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰内甲板B出现有毒气体
Dialogue: 2,1:16:45.95,1:16:48.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:16:49.35,1:16:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 2,1:16:50.25,1:16:52.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是… 是的
Dialogue: 2,1:16:52.85,1:16:57.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,比我的计算晚了两分钟 大和队长
Dialogue: 2,1:16:57.15,1:16:59.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近卫舰长?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:59.25,1:17:02.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出航准备已经结束了 拉米亚斯上校
Dialogue: 2,1:17:02.70,1:17:06.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不用穿这么夸张的东西的
Dialogue: 2,1:17:10.70,1:17:13.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 2,1:17:13.05,1:17:16.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把手举起来 把枪丢掉
Dialogue: 2,1:17:26.05,1:17:28.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜 是我是我
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.55,1:17:29.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:17:29.85,1:17:33.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好痛 怎么了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:35.20,1:17:37.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:17:39.40,1:17:46.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 笨蛋 我还以为你已经死了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:46.60,1:17:53.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好痛 要死了 真的要死了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:53.95,1:17:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你说千年号被黑了?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:56.45,1:18:00.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 奥布通知了P.L.A.N.T.以及大西洋联邦
Dialogue: 2,1:18:00.85,1:18:06.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卫星影像上看 港口周边人员移动有些许激烈
Dialogue: 2,1:18:06.85,1:18:09.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥布 我说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:14.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1286,975)}奥布军建御雷级大型机动航空母舰『棉津见』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:14.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1320,975)}先头避难舰队
Dialogue: 2,1:18:10.85,1:18:14.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我们要潜入阿耳忒弥斯要塞 救出拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:18:14.45,1:18:18.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,使用幻影胶质躲过敌人的探知接近
Dialogue: 2,1:18:18.10,1:18:20.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是尼可尔的战术啊
Dialogue: 2,1:18:20.20,1:18:23.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们负责突破主力舰队前往月球
Dialogue: 2,1:18:23.20,1:18:25.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是做诱饵吧
Dialogue: 2,1:18:25.45,1:18:28.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们知道我们的实情之后会立刻攻击奥布
Dialogue: 2,1:18:28.15,1:18:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们要在此之前破坏「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:18:30.25,1:18:31.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」本体有护罩覆盖
Dialogue: 2,1:18:31.85,1:18:33.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一般火力无法造成损坏
Dialogue: 2,1:18:33.80,1:18:36.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,射线中继点用幻影胶质伪装
Dialogue: 2,1:18:36.60,1:18:39.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在发射之前都无法预测其位置
Dialogue: 2,1:18:39.90,1:18:42.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 只有一个地方除外
Dialogue: 2,1:18:42.75,1:18:45.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,第一中继点一定在「镇魂曲」的正上方
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.30,1:18:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是射线的上方
Dialogue: 2,1:18:46.65,1:18:50.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即将发射时必定会在那里
Dialogue: 2,1:18:53.90,1:18:57.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 拉米亚斯舰长
Dialogue: 2,1:18:57.30,1:18:59.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 哪有这种道理
Dialogue: 2,1:18:59.20,1:19:02.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这艘舰船现在既不属于罗盘也不属于扎夫特
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.80,1:19:05.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而是叛乱者 也就是海贼
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.90,1:19:11.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,了解相应战斗方法的人才应该坐在这个座位上
Dialogue: 2,1:19:11.15,1:19:12.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:19:12.90,1:19:15.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 请近卫上校担任副舰长
Dialogue: 2,1:19:15.90,1:19:16.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,乐意之至
Dialogue: 2,1:19:18.40,1:19:22.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各部检查结束 主引擎输出上升中
Dialogue: 2,1:19:22.35,1:19:24.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距离稳定还有30秒
Dialogue: 2,1:19:24.15,1:19:25.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出航准备结束
Dialogue: 2,1:19:25.70,1:19:27.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,解开船索
Dialogue: 2,1:19:27.05,1:19:29.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,水流喷射器 连接
Dialogue: 2,1:19:36.40,1:19:40.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出港 千年号前进 第一战速
Dialogue: 2,1:19:51.05,1:19:55.35,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻停船 千年号 立刻停船
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.26,1:19:54.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}奥布军第二护卫舰队导弹巡洋舰『义经』
Dialogue: 2,1:19:55.35,1:19:57.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如不遵从 我方将攻击贵舰
Dialogue: 2,1:19:57.70,1:20:00.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,航路不变 两舷第二战速
Dialogue: 2,1:20:01.55,1:20:03.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.60,1:20:06.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,允许开火
Dialogue: 2,1:20:06.00,1:20:07.60,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,你明白的吧 队长
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.98,1:20:12.61,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}「义经」舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.60,1:20:08.55,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:20:08.55,1:20:11.65,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,百发百偏可是户高上校的亲传
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.65,1:20:13.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,开始射击
Dialogue: 2,1:20:23.80,1:20:25.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是一场闹剧
Dialogue: 2,1:20:25.95,1:20:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥布似乎无视了我们的警告
Dialogue: 2,1:20:30.25,1:20:34.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在说什么 离回应时间应该还有剩余的
Dialogue: 2,1:20:34.70,1:20:38.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们的议会正在商讨你们的要求
Dialogue: 2,1:20:38.55,1:20:40.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,小动作太明显了
Dialogue: 2,1:20:40.55,1:20:43.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们完全了解千年号的动向
Dialogue: 2,1:20:43.80,1:20:47.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,10分钟后我们会向贵国发射「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:20:47.00,1:20:50.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 千年号被劫持了
Dialogue: 2,1:20:50.90,1:20:51.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,刚才P.L.A.N.T.这边也…
Dialogue: 2,1:20:51.95,1:20:53.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我说过的
Dialogue: 2,1:20:53.25,1:20:55.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有一点动静我们这边就会射击
Dialogue: 2,1:20:55.45,1:20:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是误会
Dialogue: 2,1:20:56.45,1:20:58.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们完全没有…
Dialogue: 2,1:20:58.55,1:21:03.21,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,不论早晚 反正是要攻击他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(958,975)}奥布联邦领袖国
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1036,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1118,975)}欧罗法特
Dialogue: 2,1:21:03.21,1:21:08.67,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,居民避难为优先事项 奥布军全力进行支援
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.67,1:21:11.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}大规模灾难地下避难设施『天之岩户』
Dialogue: 2,1:21:08.67,1:21:11.70,Sub-CN - up,调轴-时间不对,0,0,0,,政府机构转移至淤能碁吕岛空中设施
Dialogue: 2,1:21:12.05,1:21:13.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐大人
Dialogue: 2,1:21:13.40,1:21:15.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快点 我们只有十分钟
Dialogue: 2,1:21:19.10,1:21:21.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,动力最大 离水
Dialogue: 2,1:21:21.20,1:21:24.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主推进器 启动
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.02,1:21:26.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号 出发
Dialogue: 2,1:21:37.85,1:21:39.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.65,1:21:40.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盘王国…
Dialogue: 2,1:21:40.80,1:21:43.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」准备发射
Dialogue: 2,1:21:43.35,1:21:45.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目标是奥布首都欧罗法特
Dialogue: 2,1:21:45.95,1:21:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各位市民 请遵循诱导进行避难
Dialogue: 2,1:21:50.45,1:21:52.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各位市民…
Dialogue: 2,1:21:52.25,1:21:54.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之后就拜托你们了 托亚
Dialogue: 2,1:21:54.50,1:21:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐大人 还请注意安全
Dialogue: 2,1:21:57.00,1:21:58.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请来这边
Dialogue: 2,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯哈代表
Dialogue: 2,1:22:01.75,1:22:05.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嫣红强袭 翔翼型已经为您准备好了
Dialogue: 2,1:22:05.15,1:22:05.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请尽快
Dialogue: 2,1:22:05.85,1:22:07.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,1:22:09.75,1:22:11.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然骗不过去啊
Dialogue: 2,1:22:11.95,1:22:15.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,对方从一开始就打算射击奥布的
Dialogue: 2,1:22:15.20,1:22:17.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只要给他们借口的话
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.91,1:22:22.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(988,975)}代理市长官邸内
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.91,1:22:22.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1020,975)}地下机舱
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.40,1:22:27.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,父亲大人 请保护市民
Dialogue: 2,1:22:27.10,1:22:29.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:22:29.95,1:22:31.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,再见了 奥布
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.70,1:22:34.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盘王国 听得到吗
Dialogue: 2,1:22:34.15,1:22:36.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是千年号的基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.60,1:22:39.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,国际救援频道传来通讯
Dialogue: 2,1:22:39.35,1:22:40.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:22:40.40,1:22:44.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太可惜了 我还活着
Dialogue: 2,1:22:44.15,1:22:47.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明不惜牺牲自己的国民也要杀掉我
Dialogue: 2,1:22:47.95,1:22:49.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是什么情况 修拉
Dialogue: 2,1:22:49.40,1:22:51.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么会 竟然能在那种情况下活下来
Dialogue: 2,1:22:51.75,1:22:55.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们才不是什么引导人类之人
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.20,1:22:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只是杀人狂
Dialogue: 2,1:22:56.90,1:22:58.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们知道真相
Dialogue: 2,1:22:58.70,1:23:00.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也有证据
Dialogue: 2,1:23:00.30,1:23:02.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们会将这件事告知全世界
Dialogue: 2,1:23:02.95,1:23:04.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是你们输了
Dialogue: 2,1:23:04.90,1:23:06.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我才不管什么超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:23:06.90,1:23:09.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是杀人狂的阴谋一定要挫败
Dialogue: 2,1:23:09.70,1:23:11.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟敢说出这种话
Dialogue: 2,1:23:11.50,1:23:12.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母亲大人
Dialogue: 2,1:23:12.50,1:23:14.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,干掉那个废物
Dialogue: 2,1:23:14.70,1:23:17.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」目标转为千年号
Dialogue: 2,1:23:17.45,1:23:18.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 2,1:23:18.95,1:23:20.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是妾身的命令
Dialogue: 2,1:23:20.70,1:23:22.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,月亮背面传来高能量反应
Dialogue: 2,1:23:22.70,1:23:23.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阳电子炮唐怀瑟 启动
Dialogue: 2,1:23:23.95,1:23:28.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,紧急制动
Dialogue: 2,1:23:43.40,1:23:45.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 2,1:23:51.15,1:23:53.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,受电磁波影响 失去千年号信号
Dialogue: 2,1:23:53.75,1:23:54.29,Sub-CN,调轴-时间不对-适应画面跳转,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 2,1:23:56.15,1:23:57.90,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,传令给全军
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.42,1:24:02.39,Screen,-2,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}战术战略信息综合管制机『翔翼型』
Dialogue: 2,1:23:57.90,1:24:02.70,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,这之后我们将为保卫祖国行使我们的权利
Dialogue: 2,1:24:02.70,1:24:05.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,下达国土防卫指令
Dialogue: 2,1:24:05.10,1:24:07.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗盘理事国 千年号
Dialogue: 2,1:24:07.00,1:24:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,与永恒号构建战术链接
Dialogue: 2,1:24:09.50,1:24:11.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,军队以保卫市民安全为最优先事项
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.85,1:24:14.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻继续引导市民避难
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:18.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1294,975)}超高速战术强袭支援机『流星』07号机
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:18.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1334,975)}08号机
Dialogue: 2,1:24:19.30,1:24:22.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管是换成了核动力
Dialogue: 2,1:24:22.10,1:24:25.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不过真亏他们保留了这么老的机器啊
Dialogue: 2,1:24:25.40,1:24:27.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我倒是挺喜欢的
Dialogue: 2,1:24:27.45,1:24:29.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,扎古的控制系很顺手
Dialogue: 2,1:24:29.80,1:24:30.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,伊扎克·玖尔
Dialogue: 2,1:24:30.85,1:24:32.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,决斗 出发
Dialogue: 2,1:24:32.25,1:24:33.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迪亚哥·埃尔斯曼
Dialogue: 2,1:24:33.60,1:24:36.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,暴风 出发
Dialogue: 2,1:24:38.60,1:24:41.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 玛琉小姐 我出发了
Dialogue: 2,1:24:41.35,1:24:44.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯 一定要把拉克丝带回来
Dialogue: 2,1:24:44.05,1:24:46.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:24:46.35,1:24:48.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:24:48.80,1:24:51.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号就拜托你了
Dialogue: 2,1:24:53.70,1:24:54.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:24:54.90,1:24:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真好啊 那小子
Dialogue: 2,1:24:56.90,1:25:00.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为他很单纯嘛
Dialogue: 2,1:25:00.05,1:25:02.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.65,1:25:05.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:25:10.15,1:25:11.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:25:11.40,1:25:12.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:12.65,1:25:17.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么公主大人不肯接受自己的命运
Dialogue: 2,1:25:17.65,1:25:19.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们被赐予了力量
Dialogue: 2,1:25:19.95,1:25:23.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,获得了注定的使命后 才迎来了生命
Dialogue: 2,1:25:23.50,1:25:27.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遵从它 为他人所需要着
Dialogue: 2,1:25:27.15,1:25:30.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这才是我们的幸福吧
Dialogue: 2,1:25:30.15,1:25:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得任何生命都有选择自己生存道路的权利
Dialogue: 2,1:25:35.40,1:25:38.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这并不是我所期待的命运
Dialogue: 2,1:25:38.20,1:25:40.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这场纷争不断持续下去
Dialogue: 2,1:25:40.65,1:25:46.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家烦恼 迷茫 痛苦的样子才是公主的愿望吗
Dialogue: 2,1:25:46.85,1:25:51.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,公主大人根本不明白自己有多幸运
Dialogue: 2,1:25:51.45,1:25:53.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明您可以将世界收入手中
Dialogue: 2,1:25:53.85,1:25:57.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么不接受奥费呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:57.25,1:25:59.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你觉得这样就好吗
Dialogue: 2,1:26:02.70,1:26:04.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,冷静下来了吗
Dialogue: 2,1:26:04.70,1:26:07.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也差不多该体会到自己的使命
Dialogue: 2,1:26:07.80,1:26:10.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,握住我的手了吧
Dialogue: 2,1:26:10.30,1:26:13.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,无论你问几遍 我的答案都是一样的
Dialogue: 2,1:26:13.10,1:26:16.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我所爱的人并不是你
Dialogue: 2,1:26:16.90,1:26:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和已经死了
Dialogue: 2,1:26:18.70,1:26:20.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 他并没有死
Dialogue: 2,1:26:20.80,1:26:22.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你为什么不肯接受现实
Dialogue: 2,1:26:22.90,1:26:25.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我相信他
Dialogue: 2,1:26:28.65,1:26:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:26:29.75,1:26:31.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么是那种家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:26:31.00,1:26:33.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没能成为超越者的失败品
Dialogue: 2,1:26:33.45,1:26:36.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我已经决定要爱他了
Dialogue: 2,1:26:36.30,1:26:39.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所期待的事物 他没有一点能做到
Dialogue: 2,1:26:39.70,1:26:41.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和平的世界也好
Dialogue: 2,1:26:41.20,1:26:44.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那样的家伙也有资格待在你身边吗
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.05,1:26:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,爱不需要资格
Dialogue: 2,1:26:46.00,1:26:49.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你连这点都不明白吗
Dialogue: 2,1:26:53.85,1:26:56.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算用蛮力让对方屈服
Dialogue: 2,1:26:56.10,1:26:59.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,内心也绝对不会屈服
Dialogue: 2,1:26:59.05,1:27:04.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管你做什么 都没办法让基拉消失在我心中
Dialogue: 2,1:27:04.95,1:27:06.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:27:06.65,1:27:09.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你生来就是为了与我一起统治世界的
Dialogue: 2,1:27:09.60,1:27:12.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可是为何不接受我
Dialogue: 2,1:27:12.05,1:27:13.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不接受我的爱
Dialogue: 2,1:27:13.50,1:27:19.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所爱的拉克丝·克莱茵并不是我
Dialogue: 2,1:27:24.50,1:27:26.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要去月球
Dialogue: 2,1:27:26.90,1:27:29.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这边的防卫就交给你和修拉了
Dialogue: 2,1:27:29.80,1:27:31.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:27:33.70,1:27:35.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,宰相大人前往舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:27:35.85,1:27:39.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,千年号和其余敌对战舰的动向如何
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.23,1:27:42.40,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}华纳海姆级行星间航宇宙战舰『古尔维格』舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.45,1:27:44.01,Sub-CN - up,调轴,0,0,0,,奥布舰队和地球军的残存舰队正在前往「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.01,1:27:47.14,Sub-CN,调轴,0,0,0,,预测将与扎夫特舰队交战
Dialogue: 2,1:27:47.85,1:27:50.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号正以最短路线袭来
Dialogue: 2,1:27:50.65,1:27:53.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,离与我军交战时间约为4分
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.25,1:27:55.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全舰展开鹤翼阵型
Dialogue: 2,1:27:55.75,1:27:58.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,后退 和对方保持相对速度
Dialogue: 2,1:27:58.15,1:28:01.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,十二连阳电子炮 瞄准敌舰前进路线
Dialogue: 2,1:28:01.75,1:28:04.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遮挡舰桥 转为第一战斗配置
Dialogue: 2,1:28:04.60,1:28:06.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,按照这个阵型来的话
Dialogue: 2,1:28:06.30,1:28:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们用不了阳电子炮啊
Dialogue: 2,1:28:09.40,1:28:11.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没事的 我们有新兵器
Dialogue: 2,1:28:11.80,1:28:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,展开耐热耐冲击结晶装甲
Dialogue: 2,1:28:20.00,1:28:22.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,实行巴基露露战术
Dialogue: 2,1:28:22.35,1:28:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,导弹发射时间 输入完成
Dialogue: 2,1:28:25.80,1:28:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射反光束爆雷
Dialogue: 2,1:28:29.05,1:28:30.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,启动收束火线炮 近迫武器系统
Dialogue: 2,1:28:30.80,1:28:34.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,导弹发射器状态宇宙用导弹和迎击导弹
Dialogue: 2,1:28:34.25,1:28:36.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,以最大航速正面突破
Dialogue: 2,1:28:36.95,1:28:38.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 2,1:28:45.50,1:28:47.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,甚至不进行回避
Dialogue: 2,1:28:47.10,1:28:49.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迎击导弹 近迫武器系统
Dialogue: 2,1:28:49.20,1:28:51.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,开始发射
Dialogue: 2,1:28:53.10,1:28:54.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们能顶住吗
Dialogue: 2,1:28:54.30,1:28:56.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是当然的
Dialogue: 2,1:29:02.90,1:29:05.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还挺能干的啊 贼子们
Dialogue: 2,1:29:05.20,1:29:08.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,将超高速对舰诱导弹乱射至敌人航路前方
Dialogue: 2,1:29:08.90,1:29:13.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全舰调头 全速追击敌人
Dialogue: 2,1:29:13.15,1:29:16.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,超高速导弹正在接近 正在追击
Dialogue: 2,1:29:16.15,1:29:18.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌舰队正在转头
Dialogue: 2,1:29:18.95,1:29:20.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射迎击导弹
Dialogue: 2,1:29:20.40,1:29:22.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰队转头180度
Dialogue: 2,1:29:22.70,1:29:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向左漂移 保持相对速度
Dialogue: 2,1:29:25.80,1:29:28.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全体MS出发
Dialogue: 2,1:29:38.85,1:29:40.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,连接发射器
Dialogue: 2,1:29:40.50,1:29:41.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系统全部上线
Dialogue: 2,1:29:41.80,1:29:45.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,超电容系统 1号到10号到达界限
Dialogue: 2,1:29:45.60,1:29:47.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引导系统 无异常
Dialogue: 2,1:29:47.55,1:29:51.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,路线已清空 Destiny 请出击
Dialogue: 2,1:29:51.29,1:29:54.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真·飞鸟  Destiny 出击
Dialogue: 2,1:29:54.80,1:29:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,脉冲 请出击
Dialogue: 2,1:29:57.00,1:30:00.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜玛丽亚·霍克 脉冲出击
Dialogue: 2,1:30:00.45,1:30:03.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,勇士 请出击
Dialogue: 2,1:30:03.10,1:30:06.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,希尔达·哈肯 勇士 出击
Dialogue: 2,1:30:06.70,1:30:09.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要登上战斗舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:30:09.05,1:30:10.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之后就拜托你了
Dialogue: 2,1:30:10.95,1:30:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,祝您武运昌隆
Dialogue: 2,1:30:12.15,1:30:15.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主舰桥 转为战斗模式
Dialogue: 2,1:30:15.05,1:30:16.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引导系统上线
Dialogue: 2,1:30:16.90,1:30:20.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全装甲 发射
Dialogue: 2,1:30:34.80,1:30:36.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌舰发射MS
Dialogue: 2,1:30:36.55,1:30:37.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,数量为3
Dialogue: 2,1:30:37.50,1:30:38.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迎击
Dialogue: 2,1:30:38.30,1:30:40.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 等等
Dialogue: 2,1:30:40.20,1:30:41.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和在哪里
Dialogue: 2,1:30:44.00,1:30:46.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有MS接近 数量为1
Dialogue: 2,1:30:46.80,1:30:48.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:30:48.55,1:30:50.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么他知道这里
Dialogue: 2,1:30:50.80,1:30:54.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是为了救公主仅仅只派出一台
Dialogue: 2,1:30:54.40,1:30:56.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还真令人泪目啊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:56.20,1:30:57.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉
Dialogue: 2,1:30:57.15,1:30:59.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如此用派多人来应对便是愚蠢
Dialogue: 2,1:30:59.90,1:31:01.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我来应对
Dialogue: 2,1:31:01.40,1:31:05.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,将他愚蠢的愿望击碎到体无完肤吧
Dialogue: 2,1:31:05.80,1:31:07.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,1:31:08.70,1:31:10.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:31:10.10,1:31:11.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:31:11.65,1:31:14.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这种心神不宁的感觉是什么
Dialogue: 2,1:31:14.75,1:31:18.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也不能随便分散战力
Dialogue: 2,1:31:18.25,1:31:20.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,MS队 出动
Dialogue: 2,1:31:20.05,1:31:22.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,歼灭敌人
Dialogue: 2,1:31:22.90,1:31:24.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟然是Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:31:24.50,1:31:26.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还真是爱乱来
Dialogue: 2,1:31:26.40,1:31:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,还算有点斩杀的价值吧
Dialogue: 2,1:31:29.05,1:31:32.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正好够我们来训练军队
Dialogue: 2,1:31:38.55,1:31:41.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别小看我
Dialogue: 2,1:31:43.70,1:31:47.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算是我也
Dialogue: 2,1:32:14.45,1:32:17.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这回不会失手了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1136,975)}基盘王国卫星基地内
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1166,975)}舰船舱
Dialogue: 2,1:32:31.45,1:32:33.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防卫线的内侧出现突破口
Dialogue: 2,1:32:33.90,1:32:36.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我来处理
Dialogue: 2,1:32:50.70,1:32:52.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快点快点快点
Dialogue: 2,1:32:52.85,1:32:55.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,强制封锁所有隔离墙
Dialogue: 2,1:33:02.05,1:33:05.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不懂 为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:33:06.65,1:33:08.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不想承认
Dialogue: 2,1:33:08.25,1:33:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,来走这边
Dialogue: 2,1:33:09.50,1:33:10.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奇萨卡上校
Dialogue: 2,1:33:10.80,1:33:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们上
Dialogue: 2,1:33:12.15,1:33:15.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈罗哈罗
Dialogue: 2,1:33:15.20,1:33:17.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 2,1:33:17.80,1:33:21.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,状态极佳
Dialogue: 2,1:33:21.15,1:33:23.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 控制权被夺走了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:23.30,1:33:25.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系统宕机了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:25.05,1:33:27.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在做什么啊 把修拉叫回来
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.95,1:33:30.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,无法通讯
Dialogue: 2,1:33:40.45,1:33:43.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 有敌人入侵了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:43.30,1:33:46.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,托利
Dialogue: 2,1:33:53.60,1:33:55.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:33:57.30,1:33:59.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是阿斯兰·萨拉吧
Dialogue: 2,1:33:59.05,1:34:02.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不是能读心吗
Dialogue: 2,1:34:02.15,1:34:04.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真没用啊
Dialogue: 2,1:34:04.35,1:34:06.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我杀了你
Dialogue: 2,1:34:14.50,1:34:17.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,绝对不能把你交出去
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.60,1:34:20.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是基拉来了吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:20.20,1:34:22.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在高兴什么
Dialogue: 2,1:34:22.75,1:34:26.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们也是因为有你在就能在战场上取得有利地位
Dialogue: 2,1:34:26.10,1:34:28.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才冒险来争夺你的
Dialogue: 2,1:34:28.85,1:34:30.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就只是因为这点吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:30.55,1:34:32.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:34:32.10,1:34:33.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥费也是
Dialogue: 2,1:34:33.30,1:34:37.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就因为你比较优秀 所以才爱你
Dialogue: 2,1:34:37.25,1:34:39.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家都是如此吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:39.20,1:34:40.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想要更优秀的东西
Dialogue: 2,1:34:40.60,1:34:42.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想放在身边
Dialogue: 2,1:34:42.30,1:34:45.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有这样的价值才会需要
Dialogue: 2,1:34:45.05,1:34:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才会被爱吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:46.65,1:34:50.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那真的是爱吗
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.95,1:34:52.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:34:52.15,1:34:54.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:34:55.00,1:34:56.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.65,1:35:00.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敢动一下我就弄瞎她
Dialogue: 2,1:35:00.65,1:35:02.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,毁掉嗓子也可以
Dialogue: 2,1:35:02.55,1:35:06.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能再歌唱的这个人 你还能说爱她吗
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.85,1:35:11.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 就算她目不能视 口不能言
Dialogue: 2,1:35:11.00,1:35:12.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝也是拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:35:12.85,1:35:15.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我爱她的全部
Dialogue: 2,1:35:15.15,1:35:17.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:17.10,1:35:20.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才不是因为需要才爱
Dialogue: 2,1:35:20.55,1:35:24.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为爱所以才需要
Dialogue: 2,1:35:41.60,1:35:43.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:43.00,1:35:44.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:35:44.85,1:35:46.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你太乱来了
Dialogue: 2,1:35:46.30,1:35:50.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 2,1:35:53.55,1:35:55.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:55.30,1:35:56.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 2,1:36:20.24,1:36:22.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝就拜托你了 我要去「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:23.10,1:36:25.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们很强 要小心
Dialogue: 2,1:36:25.52,1:36:26.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:36:26.17,1:36:27.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这次我不会输了
Dialogue: 2,1:36:27.73,1:36:29.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我不是一个人
Dialogue: 2,1:36:29.90,1:36:30.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:36:30.94,1:36:32.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请一定要当心
Dialogue: 2,1:36:32.61,1:36:33.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:36:40.14,1:36:43.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,偏向链接11号 已移动至初始点
Dialogue: 2,1:36:43.66,1:36:45.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:45.13,1:36:46.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,烧尽奥布
Dialogue: 2,1:36:46.43,1:36:48.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是 发射「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:48.56,1:36:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目标 奥布首都欧尔法特
Dialogue: 2,1:36:50.45,1:36:54.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,接受你所作所为的报应吧 基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,1:36:54.26,1:36:56.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」发射10秒前
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.38,1:37:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,9 8 7 6 5
Dialogue: 2,1:37:07.47,1:37:09.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修正垂直轴线误差
Dialogue: 2,1:37:09.39,1:37:10.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射电压已到达临界值
Dialogue: 2,1:37:10.86,1:37:13.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」发射口附近出现MS
Dialogue: 2,1:37:13.82,1:37:14.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:37:16.50,1:37:17.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 2,1:37:40.86,1:37:41.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,穆
Dialogue: 2,1:37:43.84,1:37:47.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀 把不可能化为可能还真是辛苦啊
Dialogue: 2,1:37:47.63,1:37:50.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,上校   太好了
Dialogue: 2,1:37:52.33,1:37:54.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一级中继点 受到攻击后消失
Dialogue: 2,1:37:54.68,1:37:57.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,偏向链接设置用舰 不可航行
Dialogue: 2,1:37:57.08,1:37:58.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」外壳损伤
Dialogue: 2,1:37:58.82,1:38:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,光束发射系统损伤
Dialogue: 2,1:38:00.63,1:38:02.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有热源正接近「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:38:02.43,1:38:04.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,立刻进行修复
Dialogue: 2,1:38:04.62,1:38:06.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶的旧人类们
Dialogue: 2,1:38:07.51,1:38:08.31,Sub-CN,调轴-适配屏字,0,0,0,,解除伪装
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.31,1:38:10.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}奥布军第一宇宙舰队战舰『草薙』
Dialogue: 2,1:38:09.35,1:38:11.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目标是镇压「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.02,1:38:13.44,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.02,1:38:13.44,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(924,975)}舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:38:11.76,1:38:13.41,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,或者全部破坏
Dialogue: 2,1:38:13.81,1:38:15.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全机可自由使用武器
Dialogue: 2,1:38:15.97,1:38:19.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,决不轻饶将死之獠牙朝向奥布之人
Dialogue: 2,1:38:27.70,1:38:29.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,MS队 躲开射线轴
Dialogue: 2,1:38:30.60,1:38:32.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,罗恩格林 发射
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.42,1:38:37.59,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(912,975)}地球联合军
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.42,1:38:37.59,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(948,975)}基地
Dialogue: 2,1:38:38.52,1:38:39.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,分离诱导炮
Dialogue: 2,1:38:40.29,1:38:42.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收束火线炮 1号 2号
Dialogue: 2,1:38:42.01,1:38:42.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,磁道炮
Dialogue: 2,1:38:44.04,1:38:45.77,Sub-CN,调轴+断句,0,0,0,,目标 敌战舰
Dialogue: 2,1:38:46.50,1:38:47.39,Sub-CN,调轴+断句,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 2,1:39:02.29,1:39:03.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑骑士小队要来了
Dialogue: 2,1:39:04.32,1:39:05.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,光束不管用
Dialogue: 2,1:39:05.61,1:39:06.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜负责掩护
Dialogue: 2,1:39:15.99,1:39:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我们也有对舰刀 我也能用
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.38,1:39:31.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是不会吸取教训的笨蛋
Dialogue: 2,1:39:31.07,1:39:33.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们是赢不了我们的
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.34,1:39:34.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,再把你们打掉
Dialogue: 2,1:39:44.93,1:39:46.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不会让你们接近千年号的
Dialogue: 2,1:39:49.23,1:39:50.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那台MS…
Dialogue: 2,1:39:52.99,1:39:54.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝 为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:39:54.52,1:39:56.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,脉冲 是露娜玛丽亚
Dialogue: 2,1:39:56.77,1:39:58.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼丝 你还活着啊
Dialogue: 2,1:39:59.13,1:40:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只有修拉才明白我的价值
Dialogue: 2,1:40:07.87,1:40:09.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你只是被利用了
Dialogue: 2,1:40:09.52,1:40:10.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这都不明白?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:10.53,1:40:12.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不也是调整者
Dialogue: 2,1:40:12.67,1:40:14.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么站在他们那边?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:14.76,1:40:16.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,受到那个蠢男人的影响
Dialogue: 2,1:40:16.34,1:40:17.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,脑子坏掉了吗?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:17.76,1:40:20.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈? 这跟真有什么关系
Dialogue: 2,1:40:20.49,1:40:23.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你才是得不到队长的关注才…
Dialogue: 2,1:40:23.19,1:40:25.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.22,1:40:38.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 这家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:40:38.69,1:40:41.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之前是因为驾驶Justice才输的
Dialogue: 2,1:40:41.54,1:40:42.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,换上Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:40:42.69,1:40:44.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,区区你们这种家伙!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:55.23,1:40:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看不到对方在想什么
Dialogue: 2,1:40:56.45,1:40:58.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这家伙 什么都不思考的吗?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:02.78,1:41:04.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一个都不许放过去
Dialogue: 2,1:41:04.46,1:41:06.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不过是一群自然人的乌合之众
Dialogue: 2,1:41:06.78,1:41:08.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,汉密尔顿 谢克特 击沉
Dialogue: 2,1:41:09.13,1:41:10.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌方MS接近
Dialogue: 2,1:41:16.88,1:41:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,贾格纳特中校 P.L.A.N.T.的来信
Dialogue: 2,1:41:20.83,1:41:25.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,议长呼吁军队停止攻击 并镇压政变
Dialogue: 2,1:41:25.26,1:41:26.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:28.07,1:41:31.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,506呼叫CP 目标投降  已解除武装
Dialogue: 2,1:41:31.72,1:41:35.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,CP收到  继续注意IED
Dialogue: 2,1:41:35.16,1:41:36.33,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,505呼叫CP…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.73,1:41:38.65,Screen,去掉了P.L.A.N.T.的点 如果是专有校对再加上,0,0,0,,{\fsp0\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.73,1:41:38.65,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}国防总部大楼
Dialogue: 2,1:41:36.33,1:41:38.01,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,继续攻击
Dialogue: 2,1:41:38.01,1:41:39.85,Sub-CN - up,调轴,0,0,0,,只要「镇魂曲」攻击了奥布
Dialogue: 2,1:41:39.85,1:41:40.69,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,时代就会改变!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:46.23,1:41:47.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,控制损伤
Dialogue: 2,1:41:58.96,1:42:00.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这边是扎夫特军情报处
Dialogue: 2,1:42:00.78,1:42:02.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,伊扎克·玖尔中校
Dialogue: 2,1:42:02.61,1:42:04.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,传达军队总部命令
Dialogue: 2,1:42:05.11,1:42:10.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,贾格纳特中校旗下的扎夫特军队 立刻停战 返回原部队
Dialogue: 2,1:42:20.18,1:42:20.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉米亚斯舰长
Dialogue: 2,1:42:22.46,1:42:24.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号 是我
Dialogue: 2,1:42:24.49,1:42:26.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,请立刻准备进行广播
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.61,1:42:29.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝大人 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 2,1:42:32.48,1:42:35.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,贾格纳特中校  你想被控叛国罪吗
Dialogue: 2,1:42:35.54,1:42:40.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这不是反叛  我们才是手握P.L.A.N.T.未来的人
Dialogue: 2,1:42:40.03,1:42:41.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是拉克丝·克莱茵
Dialogue: 2,1:42:42.78,1:42:45.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,刚刚逃离了基盘王国的监禁
Dialogue: 2,1:42:46.28,1:42:48.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在向大家对话
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.51,1:42:53.47,Screen,2,0,0,0,,{\fad(1069,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}千年号航行舰桥
Dialogue: 2,1:42:48.72,1:42:53.52,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,首先 我绝不赞同对基盘王国的意见
Dialogue: 2,1:42:54.26,1:42:59.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他们所谓公正平等的社会 是置于命运计划的统治下
Dialogue: 2,1:43:00.31,1:43:04.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正如我曾经所言  这是完全无法接受的
Dialogue: 2,1:43:05.94,1:43:11.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,无论失败 变化还是梦想 一切都不被允许的世界
Dialogue: 2,1:43:12.47,1:43:14.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人的价值由基因决定的社会
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.43,1:43:19.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的价值不能交友别人决定
Dialogue: 2,1:43:19.99,1:43:24.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,更不能通过暴力或恐怖来强迫别人
Dialogue: 2,1:43:24.46,1:43:26.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是绝不可容忍的
Dialogue: 2,1:43:27.94,1:43:32.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,任何生命都有决定自己命运的自由
Dialogue: 2,1:43:32.95,1:43:35.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也会为此而战
Dialogue: 2,1:43:36.61,1:43:42.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,永远不要让不爱你的人来决定你的价值
Dialogue: 2,1:43:47.44,1:43:48.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能再让你们继续下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.32,1:43:52.74,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}机动要塞『弥赛亚』坠落遗迹
Dialogue: 2,1:43:52.90,1:43:56.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能完成任务 我们就没有活着的意义
Dialogue: 2,1:43:56.06,1:43:57.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌舰队千年号接近
Dialogue: 2,1:43:57.95,1:44:00.76,Sub-CN,为什么是全角英语字符,0,0,0,,M1A1修拉与X20A交战中
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.76,1:44:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,旗舰 舰队向「镇魂曲」前进
Dialogue: 2,1:44:03.11,1:44:07.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,将千年号号引入舰队防御线内歼灭
Dialogue: 2,1:44:07.93,1:44:12.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母亲 接下来就拜托你了 我和修拉去解决Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:44:13.40,1:44:14.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出发 英格利特
Dialogue: 2,1:44:15.33,1:44:20.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本舰将突破敌舰队冲向敌旗舰 决战
Dialogue: 2,1:44:20.65,1:44:21.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 2,1:44:22.64,1:44:23.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:44:24.15,1:44:26.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也出击 请允许
Dialogue: 2,1:44:28.12,1:44:29.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必须将这个交给基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:44:30.37,1:44:32.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我的责任
Dialogue: 2,1:44:33.44,1:44:34.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 这…
Dialogue: 2,1:44:34.72,1:44:35.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 2,1:44:35.93,1:44:37.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这次请让我去吧
Dialogue: 2,1:44:37.88,1:44:39.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,总裁 这里是艾伯特
Dialogue: 2,1:44:39.75,1:44:41.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,机体可以以100％的性能运作
Dialogue: 2,1:44:41.95,1:44:44.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但对接需要按照手册微调
Dialogue: 2,1:44:44.51,1:44:46.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我会完美的引导 请放心
Dialogue: 2,1:44:47.60,1:44:50.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了 允许发射
Dialogue: 2,1:44:50.62,1:44:51.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 2,1:44:52.74,1:44:53.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,1:44:53.96,1:44:58.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这样也好 有时候只能在一旁看反而会更痛苦
Dialogue: 2,1:45:00.35,1:45:02.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,骑士 起飞
Dialogue: 2,1:45:02.07,1:45:04.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰·萨拉　魔蟹出击
Dialogue: 2,1:45:08.17,1:45:10.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防卫者 出击
Dialogue: 2,1:45:10.07,1:45:11.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝·克莱茵 出击
Dialogue: 2,1:45:21.80,1:45:24.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你们也证明一下自己的价值
Dialogue: 2,1:45:25.07,1:45:26.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:26.09,1:45:26.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 2,1:45:36.88,1:45:38.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,投降吧 中校
Dialogue: 2,1:45:38.53,1:45:40.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,国内的政变也失败了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:40.38,1:45:41.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别再让士兵白白送死了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:42.39,1:45:44.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么与旧世界的人为伍
Dialogue: 2,1:45:45.20,1:45:47.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这样下去 什么都改变不了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:47.89,1:45:52.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一部分人富有 豪横地行使不合理和不道德的权力的世界
Dialogue: 2,1:45:52.53,1:45:54.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,生错时代的愚蠢者们
Dialogue: 2,1:46:03.78,1:46:05.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已经坚持不住了 伊扎克
Dialogue: 2,1:46:05.50,1:46:08.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,说服有用的话  我们就不用做这种事情了
Dialogue: 2,1:46:08.55,1:46:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 2,1:46:13.54,1:46:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 2,1:46:33.26,1:46:34.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:46:34.60,1:46:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:46:37.05,1:46:39.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,老式的MS也想向我们挑战
Dialogue: 2,1:46:46.65,1:46:49.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,强弱又不是由高达的性能决定
Dialogue: 2,1:46:54.03,1:46:58.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正是如此  你这个不及我们的家伙不可能取胜
Dialogue: 2,1:47:06.03,1:47:07.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我也有我的武器
Dialogue: 2,1:47:08.23,1:47:09.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是 什么
Dialogue: 2,1:47:12.31,1:47:13.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝的爱
Dialogue: 2,1:47:17.92,1:47:19.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 2,1:47:22.23,1:47:23.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,肮脏
Dialogue: 2,1:47:24.12,1:47:27.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,像你这样的垃圾还敢提拉克丝的名字
Dialogue: 2,1:47:27.73,1:47:30.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,死上百万次也无法消除那罪孽
Dialogue: 2,1:47:46.60,1:47:48.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊 真
Dialogue: 2,1:47:49.90,1:47:50.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 2,1:48:03.69,1:48:04.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 2,1:48:04.72,1:48:05.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:48:06.60,1:48:08.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,发射双重粒子束
Dialogue: 2,1:48:14.77,1:48:15.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真难缠
Dialogue: 2,1:48:16.29,1:48:17.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,刘 丹尼尔
Dialogue: 2,1:48:17.46,1:48:18.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:48:18.17,1:48:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,结束了 废物
Dialogue: 2,1:48:28.75,1:48:32.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,从以前就开始对别人的男朋友动手动脚的
Dialogue: 2,1:48:32.47,1:48:38.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这有什么错 毕竟男人都应该喜欢我 别妒忌我
Dialogue: 2,1:48:43.89,1:48:48.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么要来阻挡我  什么都做不到的失败的你
Dialogue: 2,1:48:52.05,1:48:54.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你根本就不该出生
Dialogue: 2,1:48:54.55,1:48:57.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反而你还幸福地活着 被爱着
Dialogue: 2,1:48:58.28,1:49:00.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明就没有那种资格
Dialogue: 2,1:49:02.17,1:49:05.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被爱并不需要资格
Dialogue: 2,1:49:06.16,1:49:13.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 把那份爱交给我 她应该是我的 可是你却……
Dialogue: 2,1:49:27.47,1:49:29.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,结束了 Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.01,1:49:34.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:49:38.62,1:49:39.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 2,1:49:55.80,1:49:56.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:49:57.38,1:49:58.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没事吧 基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:49:58.88,1:49:59.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 2,1:49:59.83,1:50:00.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:50:00.69,1:50:01.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝
Dialogue: 2,1:50:03.20,1:50:04.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,进行对接
Dialogue: 2,1:50:06.13,1:50:09.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,集中火力  对Freedom进行致命一击
Dialogue: 2,1:50:13.09,1:50:16.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,相对速度+1.2  轴线修正+3
Dialogue: 2,1:50:16.47,1:50:17.22,Sub-CN,在线文档没这个了,0,0,0,,连接
Dialogue: 2,1:50:36.42,1:50:36.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:50:54.65,1:50:55.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有趣
Dialogue: 2,1:50:58.36,1:51:00.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克丝 为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:51:00.53,1:51:03.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的意志将与你同在
Dialogue: 2,1:51:04.20,1:51:06.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,今后永远 请多关照
Dialogue: 2,1:51:07.60,1:51:08.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要上咯
Dialogue: 2,1:51:08.38,1:51:09.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:51:11.17,1:51:13.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟然不惜如此也要拒绝我…
Dialogue: 2,1:51:15.88,1:51:19.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么就让你那愚蠢的爱情一起灭亡吧
Dialogue: 2,1:51:27.59,1:51:28.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这是 我的…
Dialogue: 2,1:51:50.08,1:51:51.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 那个武器
Dialogue: 2,1:51:51.90,1:51:52.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,使用干扰器
Dialogue: 2,1:51:53.29,1:51:56.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和准将申请使用粉碎炮
Dialogue: 2,1:51:56.46,1:52:00.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,总裁 拉克丝·克莱茵 准许使用
Dialogue: 2,1:52:00.18,1:52:02.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,粉碎炮启动 输出80%
Dialogue: 2,1:52:02.90,1:52:07.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌人在弥赛亚的阴影中 与我的意识相连
Dialogue: 2,1:52:18.39,1:52:23.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」的修理结束 偏向环正向第一级中继点移动中
Dialogue: 2,1:52:23.70,1:52:28.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,准备好就向奥布攻击 敌舰队也一起
Dialogue: 2,1:52:29.04,1:52:31.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,同步攻击 出发吧
Dialogue: 2,1:52:31.60,1:52:32.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.72,1:52:34.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,落入黑暗吧
Dialogue: 2,1:52:38.50,1:52:40.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真由我保护
Dialogue: 2,1:52:45.94,1:52:47.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这家伙的黑暗…
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.62,1:52:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太深了
Dialogue: 2,1:52:54.63,1:52:57.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那家伙消失了 不可能
Dialogue: 2,1:52:58.61,1:53:02.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那种迷糊的分身能奏效吗
Dialogue: 2,1:53:04.45,1:53:06.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,这种武器 我怎么不知道
Dialogue: 2,1:53:07.38,1:53:11.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,分身是这样的
Dialogue: 2,1:53:14.20,1:53:15.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,1:53:17.46,1:53:19.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群家伙的仇
Dialogue: 2,1:53:23.34,1:53:24.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,丽德尔
Dialogue: 2,1:53:24.25,1:53:25.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:25.20,1:53:26.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 2,1:53:44.43,1:53:46.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的孩子们…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:46.84,1:53:47.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:48.33,1:53:51.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,无论奥布也好P.L.A.N.T.也好都烧成灰烬
Dialogue: 2,1:53:52.33,1:53:56.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么总是我 什么事情都不顺利
Dialogue: 2,1:53:57.16,1:53:59.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:53:59.11,1:54:04.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和根本不喜欢的矮丑男交往 应该过得很幸福吧
Dialogue: 2,1:54:06.30,1:54:09.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈 喜欢又怎样 有意见?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:09.76,1:54:12.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不会吧 真喜欢 那样的山猴
Dialogue: 2,1:54:13.98,1:54:17.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,多管闲事 不喜欢为什么要交往
Dialogue: 2,1:54:18.03,1:54:20.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也值得被爱啊
Dialogue: 2,1:54:20.87,1:54:22.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 又怎样
Dialogue: 2,1:54:29.24,1:54:31.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢…
Dialogue: 2,1:54:32.17,1:54:33.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿格尼丝
Dialogue: 2,1:54:35.13,1:54:37.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阳电子炮唐怀瑟  发射
Dialogue: 2,1:54:43.11,1:54:45.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是现在 两舷全速!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:45.07,1:54:47.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敌舰主炮射程 31到65
Dialogue: 2,1:54:47.81,1:54:49.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目标 敌旗舰!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:49.88,1:54:51.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使撞上也要击落!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:53.26,1:54:58.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,绝不会忘记!死者流下的血泪 憎恨!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:58.37,1:55:00.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,绝不忘记
Dialogue: 2,1:55:03.44,1:55:04.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没有忘记…
Dialogue: 2,1:55:17.94,1:55:21.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正因如此 我们必须停止这种事情…
Dialogue: 2,1:55:27.92,1:55:30.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你很强 阿斯兰·萨拉
Dialogue: 2,1:55:32.97,1:55:35.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但 还不是我的对手
Dialogue: 2,1:55:35.60,1:55:40.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,胜利是我被赋予的使命 这就是我的存在意义!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:42.06,1:55:44.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,没用的 你无法关闭思考!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:46.25,1:55:47.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 2,1:55:52.56,1:55:58.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你这家伙 在神圣的战场竞有如此不知羞耻的妄想!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:00.89,1:56:01.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看到了!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:03.65,1:56:04.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:07.89,1:56:09.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么可能 为什么!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:09.77,1:56:11.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是无用的东西
Dialogue: 2,1:56:18.38,1:56:19.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是远程操作吗!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:20.72,1:56:22.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不知羞耻的妄想?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:23.21,1:56:24.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 2,1:56:24.39,1:56:26.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卑鄙的家伙!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:30.12,1:56:32.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然还是我更胜一筹!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:32.06,1:56:35.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,强大不在于力量 而是生存的意志!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:39.72,1:56:41.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我会输?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:48.70,1:56:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥费  修拉!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:50.25,1:56:51.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉…
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.52,1:56:54.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶 卑微的虫子们…
Dialogue: 2,1:56:54.06,1:56:56.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥费 英格利特 放弃吧
Dialogue: 2,1:56:57.49,1:57:00.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你选择那个男人 是因为你觉得他不如你
Dialogue: 2,1:57:01.33,1:57:05.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被比劣等的人包围着崇拜着 真的那么让你高兴吗!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:06.16,1:57:08.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是个自私又冷酷的女人!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:08.34,1:57:12.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算那些傻瓜们不停战斗到自取灭亡也完全不在意吗?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:22.86,1:57:23.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:57:23.70,1:57:25.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,毁掉「镇魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:57:25.40,1:57:26.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,小子
Dialogue: 2,1:57:26.22,1:57:26.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 2,1:57:27.45,1:57:30.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什么大叔 拿上你的装备
Dialogue: 2,1:57:30.07,1:57:30.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,1:57:30.93,1:57:32.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜玛丽亚使用这个
Dialogue: 2,1:57:35.99,1:57:37.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出发 露娜!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:38.77,1:57:39.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,随时准备!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:43.16,1:57:44.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年号接近
Dialogue: 2,1:57:44.65,1:57:47.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎 击落他
Dialogue: 2,1:57:47.17,1:57:48.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「镇魂曲」准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:48.71,1:57:51.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距离发射还剩300秒!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:51.94,1:57:53.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,突破!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:53.22,1:57:55.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舰首冲角 轰天 启动!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:55.62,1:57:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所有炮门 近距离装弹!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:00.55,1:58:02.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全体成员 预备冲击
Dialogue: 2,1:58:12.00,1:58:14.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,生命没有高低之分
Dialogue: 2,1:58:15.31,1:58:18.51,Sub-CN,存在,0,0,0,,谁都是另一个人珍贵的存在
Dialogue: 2,1:58:19.10,1:58:21.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 为什么我没有被爱
Dialogue: 2,1:58:21.40,1:58:24.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 一定有谁注视着你
Dialogue: 2,1:58:25.44,1:58:28.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使不是现在 但是在未来的某个人
Dialogue: 2,1:58:28.47,1:58:31.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近在咫尺而没有发现的
Dialogue: 2,1:58:36.82,1:58:40.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,未来怎么都好 我只想要现在的你
Dialogue: 2,1:58:41.26,1:58:43.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为人类的愚蠢 我们才诞生了…
Dialogue: 2,1:58:43.95,1:58:48.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,口头上说着和平与平等 却要求他人改变
Dialogue: 2,1:58:48.04,1:58:49.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,却从不自己努力改变
Dialogue: 2,1:58:50.75,1:58:52.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,并非如此
Dialogue: 2,1:58:52.68,1:58:55.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以无论什么时代纷争都未停息
Dialogue: 2,1:58:55.55,1:58:58.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使濒临灭亡也不忘恨
Dialogue: 2,1:58:59.00,1:59:01.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被眼前的得失和固执的看法所左右
Dialogue: 2,1:59:01.51,1:59:02.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,互相拖后腿
Dialogue: 2,1:59:03.30,1:59:04.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所有人都是愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:59:05.43,1:59:06.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奥费
Dialogue: 2,1:59:06.98,1:59:08.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引导者不可或缺
Dialogue: 2,1:59:09.41,1:59:12.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,结束这分裂和流血的历史
Dialogue: 2,1:59:12.43,1:59:14.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是我们诞生的意义
Dialogue: 2,1:59:14.57,1:59:17.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人不是需要才诞生
Dialogue: 2,1:59:19.15,1:59:20.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因为爱才诞生
Dialogue: 2,1:59:22.82,1:59:25.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我将用自己的手 抉择未来
Dialogue: 2,1:59:46.52,1:59:47.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 2,1:59:56.27,2:00:00.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可能 我还有使命…
Dialogue: 2,2:00:00.86,2:00:03.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已经足够了 奥费
Dialogue: 2,2:00:04.06,2:00:05.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,英格利特
Dialogue: 2,2:00:05.70,2:00:07.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道的…
Dialogue: 2,2:00:43.29,2:00:45.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,爱的反面不是憎恨
Dialogue: 2,2:00:46.63,2:00:48.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,爱的反面是冷漠
Dialogue: 2,2:00:50.24,2:00:53.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我心中有你
Dialogue: 2,2:00:54.38,2:00:57.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的心中有我吗
Dialogue: 2,2:00:59.18,2:01:03.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我会因有你而喜悦
Dialogue: 2,2:01:04.22,2:01:08.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的心中有由我而生力量
Dialogue: 2,2:01:09.85,2:01:12.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是光明还是黑暗都不明白
Dialogue: 2,2:01:14.11,2:01:16.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使未来一片模糊
Dialogue: 2,2:01:17.07,2:01:23.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但有着紧握的双手 相互支撑的心
Dialogue: 2,2:01:25.07,2:01:27.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看不见的两个人也能前进
Dialogue: 2,2:01:29.44,2:01:34.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,为了相连的两个人 为了让那双手更有力
Dialogue: 2,2:01:35.58,2:01:37.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,互相了解对方吧
Dialogue: 2,2:01:40.25,2:01:41.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,愿意告诉你
Dialogue: 2,2:01:42.33,2:01:48.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我心中许多的事 小小的事
Dialogue: 2,2:01:50.84,2:01:53.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以也请你告诉我
Dialogue: 2,2:01:54.54,2:02:00.62,Sub-CN,是不是少了点,0,0,0,,你心中许多的 小小的故事
